398
00:28:00,712 --> 00:28:02,612
Oh. how bold.

399
00:28:03,481 --> 00:28:06,917
Could you tell me the day and time
your fiancÃ© rode the train?

400
00:28:07,285 --> 00:28:10,448
December 27. 15:13.

401
00:28:10,922 --> 00:28:14,255
The Yamanote Line from
Shinjuku to Shibuya.

402
00:28:15,093 --> 00:28:17,323
December 27...

403
00:28:17,896 --> 00:28:20,660
The Yamanote Line to Shibuya...

404
00:28:20,865 --> 00:28:21,832
Yes.

405
00:28:22,033 --> 00:28:28,097
Shoko Maki Suicide January 1, 2007
From 1:15 PM.
so that you don't trouble anyone,
