478
00:34:16,554 --> 00:34:19,455
Good bye, Ms. Naomi Misora.

479
00:34:43,214 --> 00:34:47,014
Yes. Yes. Please wait one moment.

480
00:34:47,418 --> 00:34:50,216
Ryuzaki. Mr. Ukita,
from the police department...

481
00:34:50,288 --> 00:34:54,452
Is now taking a phone call concerning
