501
00:35:58,956 --> 00:36:01,982
Vice-Chief Kitamura and
his family, and...

502
00:36:02,293 --> 00:36:04,454
Bureau Chief Yagami and his family.

503
00:36:06,597 --> 00:36:08,656
I also wish to...

504
00:36:08,733 --> 00:36:11,896
place wiretaps and surveillance cameras
in both households.

505
00:36:13,271 --> 00:36:14,738
See you later, Light.

506
00:36:14,805 --> 00:36:16,670
All right. See you tomorrow.

507
00:36:19,911 --> 00:36:21,936
What's this? No one's home?

508
00:36:30,555 --> 00:36:31,681
I'm home...

509
00:36:48,739 --> 00:36:51,606
Say, Light, no one seems to be home.

510
00:36:51,676 --> 00:36:53,769
Let's play a game.
We haven't in a while.

511
00:36:55,279 --> 00:36:56,405
Are you listening?

512
00:37:01,285 --> 00:37:02,912
I-It can't be...

513
00:37:03,321 --> 00:37:05,152
I never knew that
he was doing that..!

514
00:37:05,723 --> 00:37:09,056
Does he have something in his room
that he doesn't want anyone to see?

515
00:37:09,193 --> 00:37:13,152
It's not that strange if
you consider that he's seventeen.

516
00:37:13,931 --> 00:37:15,922
I used to do that for no reason at all.

517
00:37:17,068 --> 00:37:18,365
Hey, Light.

518
00:37:18,436 --> 00:37:21,371
You've been ignoring me.
I'm getting angry.

519
00:37:22,807 --> 00:37:25,241
- No wiretaps planted on these clothes.
- Hey, Light!

520
00:37:25,776 --> 00:37:26,800
Light!

521
00:37:26,877 --> 00:37:29,072
Ryuk, there's a possibility that

522
00:37:29,146 --> 00:37:31,546
there are surveillance cameras
or wiretaps in the house...

523
00:37:31,616 --> 00:37:33,914
No, it's probably both.

524
00:37:34,118 --> 00:37:37,713
Whenever I close my room door,
I always leave the door knob

525
00:37:37,788 --> 00:37:40,348
five millimeters below
its highest position.

526
00:37:41,192 --> 00:37:42,682
In other words.

527
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:44,785
when I open the door,
if the knob is all the way up,

528
00:37:44,862 --> 00:37:47,228
there's a possibility that someone
has been in my room.

529
00:37:47,431 --> 00:37:48,921
Are you sure it wasn't your parents?

530
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:51,525
My parents and my sister wouldn't
even notice the slip of paper.

531
00:37:51,702 --> 00:37:53,533
It's suspicious that someone
would take the time

532
00:37:53,604 --> 00:37:55,037
to place the piece of paper
back where it was.

533
00:37:56,274 --> 00:37:58,799
By the way, Ryuk,
what will you do about your apples?

534
00:37:58,909 --> 00:37:59,807
Apples?

535
00:37:59,877 --> 00:38:02,038
Shinigami don't die,
so they don't starve.

536
00:38:02,580 --> 00:38:05,014
In other words, there's no problem
if I don't give you apples.

537
00:38:05,416 --> 00:38:07,509
H-Hold on a second, Light!

538
00:38:07,918 --> 00:38:09,818
Apples are like...

539
00:38:10,521 --> 00:38:14,355
W-Well... like alcohol and cigarettes
are to humans.

540
00:38:14,425 --> 00:38:16,791
I get withdrawal symptoms
if I don't have any for a while.

541
00:38:17,228 --> 00:38:19,321
If you really want to eat apples...

542
00:38:21,565 --> 00:38:24,159
find the location of all the cameras.

543
00:38:24,535 --> 00:38:28,164
There may be a place
where you can eat apples.

544
00:38:29,507 --> 00:38:30,872
Let's go, Ryuk.

545
00:38:32,109 --> 00:38:34,407
Okay! Finding cameras.

546
00:38:34,478 --> 00:38:37,413
This is also amusing!

547
00:38:42,486 --> 00:38:45,114
I love you.

548
00:38:51,028 --> 00:38:53,258
Hideki Ryuga, you're so dreamy!

549
00:38:53,331 --> 00:38:56,698
There's nobody in my classes like him!
At all!

550
00:38:56,767 --> 00:38:58,826
Sayu, eat your dinner.

551
00:38:59,236 --> 00:39:00,897
Later.

552
00:39:01,205 --> 00:39:04,265
Mr. Aizawa. are the Kitamuras
watching television now?

553
00:39:04,875 --> 00:39:05,603
Yes.

554
00:39:05,710 --> 00:39:07,268
Aside from the second eldest,

555
00:39:07,345 --> 00:39:08,937
four of them are watching
television as they eat.

556
00:39:09,246 --> 00:39:10,213
It's channel four.

557
00:39:11,415 --> 00:39:15,511
Watari. order various television stations
to broadcast our transcription.

558
00:39:15,753 --> 00:39:16,845
All right.

559
00:39:17,154 --> 00:39:18,587
NKK News Flash
That's right. I...

560
00:39:18,656 --> 00:39:20,283
Huh? What..?

561
00:39:21,125 --> 00:39:25,824
"In response to the Kira murders,
Interpol has decided to dispatch

562
00:39:25,896 --> 00:39:32,768
"1,500 investigators from
various countries to Japan."

563
00:39:33,938 --> 00:39:36,805
1,500 investigators?

564
00:39:37,608 --> 00:39:40,839
L... He's using the same method
as the first time.

565
00:39:41,846 --> 00:39:43,507
Interpol is silly.

566
00:39:43,714 --> 00:39:44,510
Huh?

567
00:39:45,316 --> 00:39:47,443
There's no point in making
this announcement.

568
00:39:47,518 --> 00:39:49,383
If they're going to send them in,

569
00:39:49,453 --> 00:39:51,353
they should let them come in
and investigate in secret.

570
00:39:51,622 --> 00:39:55,114
Even undercover FBI investigators
met untimely ends.

571
00:39:55,526 --> 00:39:57,460
These investigators could
meet the same fate.

572
00:39:57,528 --> 00:40:00,088
This is just an overblown
attempt by the police

573
00:40:00,164 --> 00:40:02,997
to shock Kira into exposing himself.

574
00:40:03,534 --> 00:40:06,264
But this probably looks suspicious
to Kira.

575
00:40:09,407 --> 00:40:11,432
Your son is very smart.

576
00:40:11,742 --> 00:40:13,835
Huh? Yes. he is.

577
00:40:17,415 --> 00:40:21,681
L-Light... I found all of the cameras.

578
00:40:22,052 --> 00:40:24,714
Shinigami sure get tired
when they try hard...

579
00:40:25,256 --> 00:40:26,848
I'll explain now.

580
00:40:27,091 --> 00:40:30,322
It's a pain to explain
so listen well.

581
00:40:31,128 --> 00:40:33,187
There are an amazing number
of cameras.

582
00:40:33,831 --> 00:40:37,494
I can only think that the guy who placed
them expected some to be found.

583
00:40:37,668 --> 00:40:39,659
There are sixty-four in all.

584
00:40:40,371 --> 00:40:43,738
So where can I eat apples
in this situation?

585
00:40:43,841 --> 00:40:46,002
It's impossible, Ryuk...

586
00:40:46,310 --> 00:40:49,177
Oh, you can't talk to me in the house...

587
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:52,178
Tell me tomorrow when we go outside.

588
00:40:52,483 --> 00:40:55,111
Okay. This problem is also correct.

589
00:40:55,586 --> 00:40:58,146
Judging from the number of cameras
and their placement,

590
00:40:58,222 --> 00:41:00,816
he's planning on making his decision
in a short amount of time...

591
00:41:01,325 --> 00:41:04,226
A normal person would
give himself away,

592
00:41:04,762 --> 00:41:06,753
but things won't be so easy
against me, L.

593
00:41:06,897 --> 00:41:07,989
Just you watch!

594
00:41:23,647 --> 00:41:25,342
I've written in the Death note

595
00:41:25,416 --> 00:41:27,748
so criminals die for
the next three weeks...

596
00:41:28,285 --> 00:41:32,051
Kira has shown that he can control
his victim's time of death...

597
00:41:32,456 --> 00:41:33,787
So in this case,

598
00:41:33,858 --> 00:41:36,224
Criminals being newly broadcast

599
00:41:36,293 --> 00:41:39,820
have to die when I haven't
had any knowledge of them.

600
00:41:40,498 --> 00:41:41,556
This is bad.

601
00:41:41,632 --> 00:41:42,963
It's my withdrawal symptoms!

602
00:41:44,235 --> 00:41:45,896
I'm going to do this, L!

603
00:41:51,709 --> 00:41:54,177
With Ryuk's information
and prior planning...

604
00:41:54,245 --> 00:41:57,942
I can kill criminals being broadcast,

605
00:41:58,015 --> 00:42:03,544
while masquerading
as a regular exam student!

606
00:42:04,255 --> 00:42:06,314
I'll solve equations with my right hand...

607
00:42:06,390 --> 00:42:08,915
and write names with my left.

608
00:42:09,927 --> 00:42:11,189
Suspect: Takichi Murao

609
00:42:13,130 --> 00:42:15,496
I'll take a potato chip...
and eat it!

610
00:42:26,710 --> 00:42:30,009
After dinner, your son didn't
watch TV or use the computer.

611
00:42:30,080 --> 00:42:31,513
He's just studying...

612
00:42:31,949 --> 00:42:34,543
That's because it's less than
ten days until the Center Test...

613
00:42:44,395 --> 00:42:46,863
Now a criminal whom
I shouldn't know about

614
00:42:46,931 --> 00:42:48,831
will die of a heart attack
in forty seconds.

615
00:42:50,401 --> 00:42:53,370
L himself will be a witness to my alibi.

616
00:43:00,678 --> 00:43:03,306
Just now, a bank clerk suspected
of embezzlement

617
00:43:03,380 --> 00:43:06,645
died of a heart attack
during questioning.

618
00:43:06,717 --> 00:43:09,277
He was shown for the first time
today on the nine o' clock news.

619
00:43:09,453 --> 00:43:10,385
It's Kira!

620
00:43:10,521 --> 00:43:15,652
Today, Kira killed people with light crimes
as soon as they were broadcast...

621
00:43:17,428 --> 00:43:20,056
Even if it is the first day
since the cameras were placed,

622
00:43:20,130 --> 00:43:22,655
the Yagami household
is interestingly in the clear.

623
00:43:35,379 --> 00:43:37,847
Next is the Naomi Misora incident...

624
00:43:37,915 --> 00:43:40,076
Shouldn't we begin
a public investigation?

625
00:43:40,718 --> 00:43:43,243
If we are to do that. it should be done
separately from the Kira case.

626
00:43:43,320 --> 00:43:45,880
We should avoid releasing photographs
and use sketches of her instead.

627
00:43:46,790 --> 00:43:47,779
Ryuzaki.

628
00:43:48,125 --> 00:43:50,992
Turn the channel to Sakura TV.
Something terrible is happening.

629
00:43:52,396 --> 00:43:55,593
In other words,
we are all Kira's hostages.

630
00:43:55,666 --> 00:43:59,124
It is also our duty as broadcasters
to make you this announcement.

631
00:43:59,570 --> 00:44:01,504
Please understand that
this is not a hoax and

632
00:44:01,572 --> 00:44:05,235
- that this is not a publicity stunt.
- Kira's hostages?

633
00:44:05,776 --> 00:44:07,175
What is this?

634
00:44:07,811 --> 00:44:09,142
Four days ago,

635
00:44:09,213 --> 00:44:11,738
our program director was
sent these four tapes.

636
00:44:11,882 --> 00:44:13,975
- These are ummistakenly from Kira.
- Sixty percent ratings?

637
00:44:14,051 --> 00:44:16,281
No, it'll go up to seventy percent.

638
00:44:16,620 --> 00:44:20,056
A tape that proves he is Kira
by predicting killings,

639
00:44:20,257 --> 00:44:24,387
Message
Four videotapes
and another with a message
to the people of the world.

640
00:44:25,529 --> 00:44:27,360
Do you suppose it's just
another fake documentary?

641
00:44:27,564 --> 00:44:31,660
It couldn't be.
Who would make such a nasty fake?

642
00:44:32,002 --> 00:44:33,230
Now, take a look.

643
00:44:41,278 --> 00:44:42,745
I am Kira.

644
00:44:43,180 --> 00:44:48,618
If this video is aired on
April 18, at exactly 5.59 PM,

645
00:44:48,686 --> 00:44:53,555
the time now is 5.59.47...
48... 49...

646
00:44:54,425 --> 00:44:56,757
Please change
the channel to Taiyo TV.

647
00:44:57,127 --> 00:44:59,527
The main newscaster,
Mr. Kazuhiko Hibima

648
00:44:59,596 --> 00:45:01,826
will die of a heart attack
at exactly six o'clock.

649
00:45:02,633 --> 00:45:03,292
Change it!

650
00:45:03,367 --> 00:45:04,800
- Hey!
- Someone!

651
00:45:05,002 --> 00:45:05,832
It can't be!

652
00:45:06,970 --> 00:45:09,438
Something bad will happen
if we don't stop this broadcast!

653
00:45:11,008 --> 00:45:12,441
Get Sakura TV on the line!

654
00:45:13,944 --> 00:45:14,740
It's no good.

655
00:45:15,145 --> 00:45:17,875
No one I know at the station
has their cell phones on.

656
00:45:18,148 --> 00:45:20,013
The lines at the station
are all busy..!

657
00:45:20,317 --> 00:45:21,249
Crap..!

658
00:45:22,753 --> 00:45:23,481
Mr. Ukita!

659
00:45:23,554 --> 00:45:26,022
I'll go to the station and
stop this at the source!

660
00:45:27,791 --> 00:45:29,850
Everyone, please listen to me.

661
00:45:30,360 --> 00:45:32,954
I don't want to kill innocents.

662
00:45:33,797 --> 00:45:37,358
I intend to
create a world without evil.

663
00:45:38,135 --> 00:45:41,593
If everyone cooperates,
this will be simple.

664
00:45:41,672 --> 00:45:42,366
Crap!

665
00:45:43,407 --> 00:45:47,503
If no one tries to catch me,
innocents will not die.

666
00:45:48,345 --> 00:45:50,813
Please be patient.

667
00:45:51,348 --> 00:45:55,148
I will change this corrupt world
into a new one...

668
00:45:55,219 --> 00:45:58,086
ruled by benevolence.

669
00:46:03,861 --> 00:46:05,488
Crap! It's closed!

670
00:46:06,864 --> 00:46:08,024
This is the police!

671
00:46:08,265 --> 00:46:09,254
Open up!

672
00:46:10,934 --> 00:46:11,958
Idiot..!

673
00:46:26,984 --> 00:46:29,248
- We interrupt scheduled programming...
- Hello?

674
00:46:29,319 --> 00:46:31,685
- to go live to the front of Sakura TV.
- Crap! I'm not getting through!

675
00:46:31,822 --> 00:46:32,948
M-Mr. Aizawa!

676
00:46:39,530 --> 00:46:41,896
Take a look!
Someone has collapsed here!

677
00:46:42,466 --> 00:46:45,333
- This is at the entrance of Sakura TV!
- M-Mr. Ukita!

678
00:46:45,636 --> 00:46:46,762
Mr. Aizawa.

679
00:46:47,971 --> 00:46:49,461
Where do you think you're going?

680
00:46:49,907 --> 00:46:51,898
Where Ukita is. of course!

681
00:46:52,075 --> 00:46:55,067
That wouldn't be good.
Please think about this calmly.

682
00:46:55,212 --> 00:46:58,010
I thought that Kira couldn't kill
unless he had a name!

683
00:46:58,248 --> 00:47:01,775
Has Kira discovered that
our names are aliases?!

684
00:47:02,219 --> 00:47:03,982
That may be so.

685
00:47:05,556 --> 00:47:08,821
I deduced that he needed a face
and a name to kill.

686
00:47:08,992 --> 00:47:10,892
But from what I can see.

687
00:47:10,961 --> 00:47:14,897
it's not entirely impossible that
he may only need a face to kill...

688
00:47:16,500 --> 00:47:19,958
All I can say is that Kira is
within that TV station building,

689
00:47:20,037 --> 00:47:23,973
or is in a place where he can watch
who enters the building.

690
00:47:24,041 --> 00:47:27,636
If Kira is in the area. isn't that
more of a reason to go?!

691
00:47:27,778 --> 00:47:31,077
He may have only placed
surveillance cameras in the area.

692
00:47:33,584 --> 00:47:34,414
R-Ryuzaki!

693
00:47:54,771 --> 00:47:56,636
What in the world is this?!

694
00:47:59,042 --> 00:48:01,977
Where is the studio where
they're airing the Kira video?!

695
00:48:02,412 --> 00:48:03,606
There's been a crash!

696
00:48:03,680 --> 00:48:06,171
A vehicle has just crashed into
the Sakura TV studio!

697
00:48:07,417 --> 00:48:10,580
That's one way to get into
the building without being seen.

698
00:48:10,854 --> 00:48:12,446
But who would?

699
00:48:13,557 --> 00:48:15,957
This is the police!
Stop this program!

700
00:48:16,426 --> 00:48:17,620
Wh-What's this?!

701
00:48:18,028 --> 00:48:19,996
Stop the Kira tape immediately!

702
00:48:20,063 --> 00:48:22,531
W-Wait a second. detective!

703
00:48:22,833 --> 00:48:25,825
If you stop this, Kira will kill us...

704
00:48:26,937 --> 00:48:28,063
Bring them out!

705
00:48:28,405 --> 00:48:31,238
If you give them to me now,
you won't be killed!

706
00:48:34,912 --> 00:48:36,709
It's from Bureau Chief Yagami.

707
00:48:37,014 --> 00:48:39,073
Call him back
and give the phone to me.

708
00:48:39,783 --> 00:48:41,648
Quickly, get me Ryuzaki!

709
00:48:41,919 --> 00:48:42,908
It's me.

710
00:48:43,186 --> 00:48:46,280
So that was you
in the patrol wagon, Mr. Yagami.

711
00:48:46,490 --> 00:48:49,152
Yes... I just couldn't take it anymore...

712
00:48:49,726 --> 00:48:53,162
I've confiscated all the tapes.
I'll bring them to you.

713
00:49:04,641 --> 00:49:07,132
God is truly on my side...

714
00:49:07,711 --> 00:49:10,578
But this time. instead of God.
it's a Shinigami.

715
00:49:11,815 --> 00:49:13,146
So it seems.

716
00:49:14,184 --> 00:49:16,846
He probably has the Shinigami eyes...

717
00:49:17,688 --> 00:49:21,749
In other words.
he's a far deadlier Kira than I am...

718
00:49:22,492 --> 00:49:23,823
A second Kira!

719
00:49:24,494 --> 00:49:26,519
Yes. There is a high possibility

720
00:49:26,596 --> 00:49:28,860
that this Kira is pretending
to be Kira.

721
00:49:29,099 --> 00:49:32,330
In other words. we should refer
to him as "Second Kira."

722
00:49:32,836 --> 00:49:34,804
If the impostor slips up and gets caught,

723
00:49:34,871 --> 00:49:37,396
the police might find out about
the Death Note. That would be disastrous.

724
00:49:38,108 --> 00:49:40,576
I can't leave him alone
for too long.

725
00:49:43,413 --> 00:49:46,780
What I need to do
most now is...

726
00:49:46,850 --> 00:49:48,943
to cooperate with the investigation...

727
00:49:49,019 --> 00:49:52,386
and to figure out L's moves
and the fake Kira's moves...

728
00:49:53,690 --> 00:49:54,952
Mr. Yagami.

729
00:49:55,325 --> 00:49:58,988
May I ask your son to help us
with this investigation?

730
00:50:00,297 --> 00:50:04,495
Does that mean
he's no longer a suspect?

731
00:50:04,968 --> 00:50:07,163
If we catch one Kira...

732
00:50:07,237 --> 00:50:12,231
I think we'll get a hint as to
how we can catch the other.

733
00:50:19,016 --> 00:50:20,244
Say, Misa.

734
00:50:20,784 --> 00:50:23,150
I gave you the Death Note...

735
00:50:23,387 --> 00:50:26,788
so why don't you use it
for yourself more often?

736
00:50:27,224 --> 00:50:29,089
I am using it for myself.

737
00:50:29,326 --> 00:50:31,419
I believe in what Kira is doing.

738
00:50:31,895 --> 00:50:33,954
I want to know what kind
of person Kira is.

739
00:50:34,731 --> 00:50:36,926
I want to get to know him
in person.

740
00:50:37,834 --> 00:50:39,802
That's a really dangerous game
you're playing.

741
00:50:40,103 --> 00:50:43,368
You might be killed.
Do you understand that?

742
00:50:43,840 --> 00:50:45,501
It's all right.

743
00:50:45,575 --> 00:50:48,373
I'm sure that Kira is kind
to those with pure hearts.

744
00:50:48,678 --> 00:50:50,043
Just in case something happens...

745
00:50:50,113 --> 00:50:53,276
I'm stronger because
I have the eyes!

746
00:51:02,926 --> 00:51:05,486
My father told me
to come here...

747
00:51:05,662 --> 00:51:06,924
Am I early?

748
00:51:13,336 --> 00:51:14,564
An unknown caller?

749
00:51:16,540 --> 00:51:17,370
Yes?

750
00:51:17,607 --> 00:51:19,234
Are you Light Yagami?

751
00:51:19,910 --> 00:51:20,934
That would be me.

752
00:51:21,812 --> 00:51:22,744
This is L.

753
00:51:24,881 --> 00:51:27,907
Today, I would like to discuss
the Kira incident.

754
00:51:27,984 --> 00:51:30,350
I had your father ask you
to come here.

755
00:51:31,321 --> 00:51:33,687
I'm sorry for doing this
at such a busy time.

756
00:51:34,324 --> 00:51:35,382
It's all right.

757
00:51:35,826 --> 00:51:37,316
I shall lead you to me.

758
00:53:01,478 --> 00:53:05,107
I'm L. Thank you for coming today.

759
00:53:05,649 --> 00:53:07,116
It's all right, L.

760
00:53:07,184 --> 00:53:11,177
I've respected your abilities
for quite some time now.

761
00:53:13,323 --> 00:53:16,486
I see. I'm honored.

762
00:53:19,162 --> 00:53:21,460
Refer to me as Ryuzaki
while you're here.

763
00:53:21,698 --> 00:53:26,135
On to business.
I want you to watch a video.

764
00:53:26,469 --> 00:53:27,629
Please have a seat.

765
00:53:28,138 --> 00:53:29,503
All right, Ryuzaki.

766
00:53:33,577 --> 00:53:34,771
Now then...

767
00:53:41,785 --> 00:53:43,047
It isn't starting.

768
00:53:43,186 --> 00:53:44,983
Oh, I forgot.

769
00:53:45,522 --> 00:53:47,285
Please begin.

770
00:53:52,429 --> 00:53:54,363
This was that tape that was aired...

771
00:53:54,431 --> 00:53:56,490
No. It's a different one.

772
00:53:57,234 --> 00:54:00,931
We believe that this Kira
is a different Kira.

773
00:54:01,004 --> 00:54:03,131
Just the other day, we posed as
the real Kira

774
00:54:03,206 --> 00:54:04,696
and released a message
to the impostor.

775
00:54:05,475 --> 00:54:07,340
I am the real Kira.

776
00:54:07,410 --> 00:54:09,469
To the person
who has used my name.

777
00:54:09,546 --> 00:54:13,846
I shall punish you if you continue
to cause trouble.

778
00:54:15,619 --> 00:54:16,847
Did you see this one?

779
00:54:17,254 --> 00:54:20,883
Yes. So it was a video
made by the police.

780
00:54:21,558 --> 00:54:24,288
This is the response to our message.

781
00:54:24,728 --> 00:54:26,559
It's a bit incomprehensible...

782
00:54:27,998 --> 00:54:30,831
Kira, thank you for
your response.

783
00:54:31,268 --> 00:54:36,137
I shall do as you say.
I want to see you.

784
00:54:36,439 --> 00:54:40,239
What's this?
What is he thinking..?

785
00:54:40,744 --> 00:54:43,110
I don't think you have the eyes...

786
00:54:43,613 --> 00:54:47,674
But I won't kill you. Don't worry.

787
00:54:48,518 --> 00:54:52,579
Is he stupid?!
He talked about the Shinigami Eyes...

788
00:54:56,993 --> 00:55:01,327
- Let me know how we can meet.
- No, don't panic.

789
00:55:01,698 --> 00:55:04,064
When we do,
we can confirm our identities

790
00:55:04,134 --> 00:55:06,125
by showing our Shinigami
to each other.

791
00:55:06,469 --> 00:55:08,096
It's no good.

792
00:55:08,838 --> 00:55:10,567
I have to do something
about him quickly...

793
00:55:27,624 --> 00:55:28,613
What do you think?

794
00:55:29,526 --> 00:55:30,959
I'm surprised...

795
00:55:31,027 --> 00:55:34,292
This Kira seems to care more
about meeting Kira

796
00:55:34,364 --> 00:55:36,525
than about Kira's ideals...

797
00:55:37,434 --> 00:55:40,801
And more importantly,
that word, "Shinigami."

798
00:55:41,404 --> 00:55:42,393
Yes...

799
00:55:55,452 --> 00:55:56,919
That's good...

800
00:55:57,721 --> 00:55:59,689
Yeah. like that..!

801
00:55:59,989 --> 00:56:00,921
That was great...

802
00:56:00,990 --> 00:56:02,457
Just great, Misa.

803
00:56:02,559 --> 00:56:03,787
It was wonderful!

804
00:56:06,396 --> 00:56:08,159
I'm worn out...

805
00:56:08,498 --> 00:56:11,626
Modeling sure uses
a lot of energy!

806
00:56:12,869 --> 00:56:14,029
Say, Rem...

807
00:56:14,137 --> 00:56:14,899
Hmm?

808
00:56:15,405 --> 00:56:16,702
Can I ask you something?

809
00:56:16,973 --> 00:56:17,769
What is it?

810
00:56:18,475 --> 00:56:21,444
Shinigami must each
have a Death Note.

811
00:56:21,811 --> 00:56:23,938
To have a human obtain
and play with a Death Note

812
00:56:24,013 --> 00:56:25,742
requires a Shinigami to
have two Death Notes...

813
00:56:26,082 --> 00:56:29,711
That means that Ryuk, the Shinigami
who gave the Death Note to Kira,

814
00:56:29,786 --> 00:56:32,346
tricked the Shinigami lord into
giving him two notebooks, right?

815
00:56:32,989 --> 00:56:33,853
That's right.

816
00:56:34,257 --> 00:56:35,588
Does that mean you did that, too?

817
00:56:35,825 --> 00:56:40,159
No. The Shinigami lord
is not that easily fooled.

818
00:56:40,764 --> 00:56:42,322
Then how?

819
00:56:43,233 --> 00:56:46,396
I am one of only a few
in the Shinigami World...

820
00:56:46,569 --> 00:56:48,537
Let's just say...

821
00:56:48,605 --> 00:56:52,803
that I know how to kill
a Shinigami.

822
00:56:59,516 --> 00:57:01,848
There once was a Shinigami
named Gelus

823
00:57:01,918 --> 00:57:05,854
who used to watch a certain girl
from the Shinigami World...

824
00:57:27,577 --> 00:57:29,772
I love you more than
anyone else in the world!

825
00:57:29,846 --> 00:57:31,711
I'm always watching you!
I want to protect you!

826
00:57:36,252 --> 00:57:38,277
H-Hey. Stop!

827
00:57:41,658 --> 00:57:45,754
Gelus did something that
a Shinigami should not do.

828
00:57:56,072 --> 00:58:01,032
Gelus used his Death Note
to save the girl.

829
00:58:02,378 --> 00:58:03,936
But that was not good...

830
00:58:05,915 --> 00:58:09,578
Shinigami shorten humans' lives...

831
00:58:09,819 --> 00:58:12,617
They only exist to take them...

832
00:58:18,795 --> 00:58:20,387
At that moment,

833
00:58:20,463 --> 00:58:25,765
Gelus became something which
was neither sand nor rust. and died.

834
00:58:28,037 --> 00:58:30,801
Only his Death Note was left.

835
00:58:37,313 --> 00:58:39,645
Does that mean that
the Shinigami wouldn't have died

836
00:58:39,716 --> 00:58:41,911
if he hadn't fallen in love with that girl?

837
00:58:42,452 --> 00:58:43,578
That's right.

838
00:58:46,890 --> 00:58:48,517
Then...

839
00:58:49,692 --> 00:58:53,992
the Shinigami named Gelus
was the one who saved me...

840
00:58:59,035 --> 00:59:02,471
I see. In order to kill a Shinigami,

841
00:59:02,539 --> 00:59:05,406
you need him to fall in love with a human
and have him save that person.

842
00:59:06,442 --> 00:59:10,276
Now I have something
I can tell Kira.

843
00:59:10,847 --> 00:59:16,843
I wonder if he knows...
how to kill a Shinigami?

844
00:59:49,252 --> 00:59:51,049
P-Pleased to meet you...

845
00:59:51,421 --> 00:59:52,649
I'm Misa Amane.

846
00:59:53,389 --> 00:59:56,586
I thought you might be worried
if you were watching TV...

847
00:59:56,659 --> 00:59:58,627
I just couldn't take it any more.

848
00:59:59,062 --> 01:00:00,723
Take this notebook...

849
01:00:01,798 --> 01:00:02,958
A Death Note...

850
01:00:10,373 --> 01:00:11,704
A Shinigami!

851
01:00:12,609 --> 01:00:13,871
It's Fake Kira...

852
01:00:15,078 --> 01:00:16,136
Have a seat.

853
01:00:17,213 --> 01:00:18,805
Th-Thank you.

854
01:00:29,859 --> 01:00:31,349
How did you find me?

855
01:00:31,728 --> 01:00:33,320
Oh... I thought so.

856
01:00:33,396 --> 01:00:35,387
You haven't made the eye bargain.

857
01:00:36,833 --> 01:00:38,596
When you have the Shinigami eyes,

858
01:00:38,668 --> 01:00:41,569
you can see
a person's lifespan and age.

859
01:00:41,971 --> 01:00:44,201
But you cannot see the lifespan
of someone

860
01:00:44,273 --> 01:00:46,138
who has a Death Note.

861
01:00:48,011 --> 01:00:49,342
Found you.

862
01:00:53,082 --> 01:00:56,279
Yagami... Tsuki, is it?

863
01:00:56,786 --> 01:00:58,777
He's the only one whose lifespan
I can't see.

864
01:00:59,188 --> 01:01:00,849
Light Yagami
He's Kira!

865
01:01:01,457 --> 01:01:04,585
I didn't think it would be
so easy to find him.

866
01:01:05,962 --> 01:01:08,328
Well. I understand that. but...

867
01:01:08,665 --> 01:01:11,156
What would happen
if you were caught by the police

868
01:01:11,234 --> 01:01:13,395
and Kira's secret was discovered?

869
01:01:13,970 --> 01:01:15,062
It's all right...

870
01:01:15,138 --> 01:01:18,266
I wasn't caught and if
I continue to do as you say,

871
01:01:18,341 --> 01:01:20,070
I won't be.

872
01:01:20,643 --> 01:01:21,541
Right?

873
01:01:22,178 --> 01:01:24,408
And I can see L's name...

874
01:01:25,181 --> 01:01:26,910
I will be your eyes...

875
01:01:28,284 --> 01:01:29,308
So...

876
01:01:31,921 --> 01:01:32,785
So?

877
01:01:33,990 --> 01:01:35,617
Make me your girlfriend!

878
01:01:37,660 --> 01:01:38,786
Girlfriend?!

879
01:01:39,662 --> 01:01:40,424
Yes...

880
01:01:42,498 --> 01:01:45,797
If I treat her badly,
she might kill me...

881
01:01:46,369 --> 01:01:47,393
But...

882
01:01:48,204 --> 01:01:49,136
It's impossible.

883
01:01:49,605 --> 01:01:52,165
The tapes you sent to
the television station

884
01:01:52,241 --> 01:01:54,334
all had the same fingerprints
on them.

885
01:01:54,644 --> 01:01:56,509
Those aren't my fingerprints.

886
01:01:56,579 --> 01:01:59,571
I, at least, think before doing things.

887
01:02:01,617 --> 01:02:03,050
If you really don't believe me...

888
01:02:04,320 --> 01:02:07,380
you can hold on to
my Death Note.

889
01:02:09,258 --> 01:02:11,749
Now I can't kill you.

890
01:02:11,828 --> 01:02:15,628
And you can kill me once
I'm of no use to you.

891
01:02:16,265 --> 01:02:18,290
Why is she going this far?

892
01:02:19,469 --> 01:02:22,165
But you might have removed
several pages from the Death Note

893
01:02:22,238 --> 01:02:24,399
and hid them somewhere.

894
01:02:25,575 --> 01:02:27,440
Why are you so suspicious?!

895
01:02:28,144 --> 01:02:31,170
I'm perfectly happy to be used by you!

896
01:02:31,647 --> 01:02:32,773
Believe me!

897
01:02:33,916 --> 01:02:35,747
How can you go so far
as to say that?

898
01:02:38,154 --> 01:02:39,781
About a year ago,

899
01:02:39,856 --> 01:02:44,316
a burglar killed my parents
right in front of me.

900
01:02:45,194 --> 01:02:47,059
I couldn't forgive him...

901
01:02:48,131 --> 01:02:49,962
But the trial dragged along

902
01:02:50,032 --> 01:02:52,364
and he was even looking
at an acquittal...

903
01:02:53,336 --> 01:02:57,238
That's when Kira punished him.

904
01:02:58,341 --> 01:03:01,469
Kira means everything to me.

905
01:03:03,746 --> 01:03:08,080
I just... I just wanted to
meet you so badly...

906
01:03:08,551 --> 01:03:10,178
I wanted to thank you...

907
01:03:36,646 --> 01:03:37,840
All right...

908
01:03:38,014 --> 01:03:41,245
I can't be your boyfriend,
but I can act as if I am.

909
01:03:41,851 --> 01:03:46,185
Those eyes for which
you gave up half of your life

910
01:03:46,255 --> 01:03:49,349
will serve me as a weapon.

911
01:03:50,893 --> 01:03:55,296
Thank you...
I'll try to make you love me.

912
01:04:16,385 --> 01:04:17,818
That's not true.

913
01:04:17,954 --> 01:04:19,888
I just have a knack for
getting things done.

914
01:04:30,132 --> 01:04:32,896
Oh! Yagami.

915
01:04:33,836 --> 01:04:34,894
Hello.

916
01:04:39,442 --> 01:04:41,000
What's wrong, Ryuzaki?

917
01:04:41,277 --> 01:04:43,472
Is it all right for you
to come out here?

918
01:04:43,913 --> 01:04:46,677
I'm all right as long as
you're not Kira.

919
01:04:48,651 --> 01:04:50,243
I forgot to tell you

920
01:04:50,319 --> 01:04:53,846
that I still think that
you might be Kira.

921
01:04:54,657 --> 01:04:57,455
Well, even so, there's only
a five-percent chance that you are him...

922
01:04:58,294 --> 01:05:00,125
And you're the only person
outside now

923
01:05:00,196 --> 01:05:02,687
who knows that I'm L...

924
01:05:03,366 --> 01:05:06,028
I've told everyone on
the investigative team...

925
01:05:06,102 --> 01:05:09,731
that if I die soon, you're Kira.

926
01:05:18,080 --> 01:05:23,074
He weakened my resolve
as soon as I was going to kill him...

927
01:05:23,986 --> 01:05:26,386
This is exactly what he wants...

928
01:05:27,390 --> 01:05:29,381
Light, there you are!

929
01:05:30,559 --> 01:05:33,289
I came because
we were filming nearby.

930
01:05:33,362 --> 01:05:35,262
Misa! You idiot...

931
01:05:35,665 --> 01:05:39,101
Is this a friend of yours?
He's wonderfully individualistic...

932
01:05:40,469 --> 01:05:42,266
No! I've won!

933
01:05:42,738 --> 01:05:45,434
Misa can see Ryuzaki's real name!

934
01:05:46,175 --> 01:05:49,474
I'm Light's girlfriend, Misa Amane.
Pleased to meet you.

935
01:05:50,012 --> 01:05:51,240
I'm Hideki Ryuga.

936
01:05:51,514 --> 01:05:53,675
Huh? Hideki Ryuga?

937
01:05:54,483 --> 01:05:57,884
Yeah. He has the same first name
and last name as that pop idol.

938
01:05:58,154 --> 01:05:59,280
Isn't that amusing?

939
01:05:59,956 --> 01:06:02,618
But that's not the name I see...

940
01:06:03,192 --> 01:06:07,322
Ryuzaki, coming out here
has backfired on you!

941
01:06:12,234 --> 01:06:13,633
Why is he laughing?

942
01:06:14,303 --> 01:06:16,430
Does this mean he noticed?

943
01:06:17,173 --> 01:06:19,971
But if he's guessed that
she's the Second Kira,

944
01:06:20,042 --> 01:06:21,873
there's no way
he would be laughing...

945
01:06:23,346 --> 01:06:24,608
Yagami...

946
01:06:26,716 --> 01:06:28,183
I'm jealous.

947
01:06:29,752 --> 01:06:31,481
You're Misa, the pop idol
from the October edition of Eighteen.

948
01:06:31,554 --> 01:06:32,578
I'm a fan.

949
01:06:32,655 --> 01:06:35,180
What? Really? I'm so happy!

950
01:06:35,391 --> 01:06:37,484
Hey, that girl.
Isn't she Misa-Misa?!

951
01:06:37,660 --> 01:06:39,787
It's true. It's Misa-Misa!

952
01:06:39,862 --> 01:06:41,386
- What? Misa-Misa?
- The real one?!

953
01:06:41,464 --> 01:06:43,591
I should've known I'd be recognized
where there are lots of young people.

954
01:06:43,933 --> 01:06:45,332
I watch you every month.

955
01:06:45,568 --> 01:06:46,933
Keep up the good work.

956
01:06:47,269 --> 01:06:49,169
Yeah. Thank you.
I'll give it my best...

957
01:06:49,305 --> 01:06:50,636
What's going on?

958
01:06:50,706 --> 01:06:51,673
Misa!

959
01:06:52,541 --> 01:06:54,975
It's already time!
Do you want to be late again?!

960
01:06:55,177 --> 01:06:56,940
Oh, sorry, Yoshi.

961
01:06:57,113 --> 01:06:57,875
Let's go!

962
01:06:57,947 --> 01:06:58,936
Oh, okay.

963
01:07:00,249 --> 01:07:03,343
That's good...
Once Misa's out of here,

964
01:07:03,419 --> 01:07:06,081
I just have to give her a call
and ask her for L's name.

965
01:07:06,622 --> 01:07:09,955
See you after work, Light...

966
01:07:15,031 --> 01:07:17,090
Now then, shall we go, Yagami?

967
01:07:17,500 --> 01:07:18,489
Well...

968
01:07:18,567 --> 01:07:22,094
I have a lecture soon.
Could we talk later?

969
01:07:22,738 --> 01:07:25,263
I see. Well then, see you later...

970
01:07:37,887 --> 01:07:38,911
It's over...

971
01:07:40,356 --> 01:07:43,291
It's been fun... L.

972
01:07:58,374 --> 01:07:59,136
Yes?

973
01:08:00,743 --> 01:08:05,203
Yes. I see. We did it.
All right.

974
01:08:07,216 --> 01:08:11,516
The news I have to tell you
is both good and bad...

975
01:08:12,054 --> 01:08:13,453
We've taken Misa Amane
into custody

976
01:08:13,522 --> 01:08:15,387
under suspicion of
being the Second Kira.

977
01:08:17,960 --> 01:08:20,019
How long has he known
about Misa?

978
01:08:20,930 --> 01:08:24,229
There were hairs and fabric threads.
among other things...

979
01:08:24,300 --> 01:08:28,896
on the masking tape used to wrap
the tapes sent by the Second Kira

980
01:08:28,971 --> 01:08:31,303
which matched samples
from her room.

981
01:08:32,741 --> 01:08:34,470
There will probably be a riot

982
01:08:34,543 --> 01:08:36,636
if we accuse her of
being the Second Kira.

983
01:08:36,846 --> 01:08:38,609
So we're saying that her manager
surrendered voluntarily

984
01:08:38,681 --> 01:08:40,342
on charges of drug possession.

985
01:08:41,250 --> 01:08:43,275
The truth will probably
never become public.

986
01:08:51,627 --> 01:08:53,094
R-Ryuzaki!

987
01:08:53,395 --> 01:08:54,589
What is this?!

988
01:08:55,197 --> 01:08:57,495
I've apprehended her
as the Second Kira.

989
01:08:57,566 --> 01:08:59,363
It's necessary, at the very least.

990
01:09:00,569 --> 01:09:01,558
Also, Mr. Yagami...

991
01:09:02,838 --> 01:09:07,207
I'm probably going to have
to bring in Light to testify as Kira.

992
01:09:07,443 --> 01:09:08,671
Please be prepared.

993
01:09:17,086 --> 01:09:18,519
Oh. Rem.

994
01:09:19,255 --> 01:09:20,916
Light Yagami...

995
01:09:21,357 --> 01:09:24,918
Misa forfeited her ownership
of the Death Note.

996
01:09:26,262 --> 01:09:30,062
All of her memories concerning
the notebook have been erased.

997
01:09:30,599 --> 01:09:33,762
She no longer can reveal
your secret...

998
01:09:35,871 --> 01:09:39,739
Misa even refused my offer
to help her escape.

999
01:09:40,676 --> 01:09:44,339
She probably figured that
she would be causing you trouble

1000
01:09:44,413 --> 01:09:47,849
if they thought she
had special powers...

1001
01:09:48,817 --> 01:09:52,685
She did it because she wants
you to love her.

1002
01:09:53,822 --> 01:09:55,289
Light Yagami...

1003
01:09:56,225 --> 01:10:00,059
I'll kill you if you don't save Misa.

1004
01:10:38,934 --> 01:10:40,401
It's been a week

1005
01:10:40,469 --> 01:10:42,767
since we've detained Amane
and Light Yagami...

1006
01:10:43,405 --> 01:10:46,374
Kira has completely
stopped killing criminals...

1007
01:10:47,509 --> 01:10:49,739
We're pretty sure that
they're Kira...

1008
01:10:50,379 --> 01:10:54,713
But why did Light accept
his detention so peacefully?

1009
01:10:55,284 --> 01:10:57,115
Even if he were Kira,

1010
01:10:57,186 --> 01:11:01,384
did he think he could act
as if he knew nothing?

1011
01:11:02,791 --> 01:11:04,725
It's not like Light Yagami...

1012
01:11:04,793 --> 01:11:07,284
No, it's not like Kira.

1013
01:11:17,006 --> 01:11:18,064
Light...

1014
01:11:18,540 --> 01:11:19,905
It's been just one week...

1015
01:11:19,975 --> 01:11:21,602
But I'm pretty sure
you're worn out...

1016
01:11:22,011 --> 01:11:23,342
Are you all right?

1017
01:11:25,881 --> 01:11:29,442
Now that I've come this far,
I think it's about time...

1018
01:11:34,657 --> 01:11:38,718
Yeah. I don't think I look
very cool in this situation...

1019
01:11:38,794 --> 01:11:41,194
But I'm going to discard...

1020
01:11:42,665 --> 01:11:44,030
Such worthless pride.

1021
01:11:58,947 --> 01:12:00,175
Got it.

1022
01:12:03,886 --> 01:12:04,978
See you later.

1023
01:12:18,534 --> 01:12:21,025
Why am I doing this?

1024
01:12:22,237 --> 01:12:23,261
Ryuzaki...

1025
01:12:23,706 --> 01:12:26,231
I did indeed agree to be detained

1026
01:12:26,308 --> 01:12:27,866
and chose to do this...

1027
01:12:28,544 --> 01:12:32,571
But I just realized that
doing this is meaningless!

1028
01:12:33,482 --> 01:12:35,416
Why? Because I'm not Kira!

1029
01:12:35,484 --> 01:12:37,281
Get me out of here quickly!

1030
01:12:38,020 --> 01:12:40,284
What's wrong, Light Yagami?

1031
01:12:40,356 --> 01:12:42,483
What you're saying is crazy...

1032
01:12:42,558 --> 01:12:45,686
But... for some reason it feels
like it's the truth.

1033
01:12:46,261 --> 01:12:48,889
Let me out of here quickly.
This is a waste of time.

1034
01:12:48,964 --> 01:12:51,330
No. I can't let you out.

1035
01:12:51,767 --> 01:12:53,166
You're wrong.

1036
01:12:53,635 --> 01:12:55,330
I can understand why
you deduced

1037
01:12:55,404 --> 01:12:58,703
from the investigative situation
that I'm Kira, but it's a trap!

1038
01:12:59,341 --> 01:13:00,672
I'm not Kira!

1039
01:13:01,176 --> 01:13:04,077
Zoom in or something and
look at my eyes!

1040
01:13:04,546 --> 01:13:07,208
Are these the eyes of
someone who is lying?

1041
01:13:11,720 --> 01:13:13,051
Misa Amane...

1042
01:13:13,822 --> 01:13:15,346
Mr. Stalker. what is it?

1043
01:13:15,758 --> 01:13:17,191
Are you planning to let me go?

1044
01:13:17,893 --> 01:13:20,623
Do you know why
you're being detained here?

1045
01:13:20,863 --> 01:13:23,593
Why? Is it because
I'm a pop idol?

1046
01:13:24,266 --> 01:13:28,259
But you're the first stalker
who's gone this far.

1047
01:13:28,704 --> 01:13:31,172
So you really don't know
who Kira is?

1048
01:13:31,573 --> 01:13:32,505
Huh?

1049
01:13:32,574 --> 01:13:35,407
This again?
That's what I want to know.

1050
01:13:35,477 --> 01:13:37,411
Wh-What's going on?

1051
01:13:37,546 --> 01:13:40,276
Since yesterday, criminals are
suddenly dying again

1052
01:13:40,349 --> 01:13:42,214
after more than two weeks
of nothing.

1053
01:13:42,351 --> 01:13:43,283
Yeah.

1054
01:13:43,352 --> 01:13:44,580
Kira Returns
It's the return of Kira.

1055
01:13:50,759 --> 01:13:53,353
I don't know what's going on...

1056
01:14:02,900 --> 01:14:05,960
Isn't it great that Light and Misa-Misa
can return to their normal lives?

1057
01:14:06,036 --> 01:14:08,300
They're still under surveillance, though.

1058
01:14:08,639 --> 01:14:11,437
Matsuda, stop calling
her Misa-Misa.

1059
01:14:12,276 --> 01:14:16,110
Say... This doesn't really
feel like a date.

1060
01:14:16,547 --> 01:14:19,311
Even though I asked you to help
with the investigation,

1061
01:14:19,383 --> 01:14:21,681
you and Light are still suspects.

1062
01:14:21,985 --> 01:14:23,475
Please put up with this.

1063
01:14:23,954 --> 01:14:26,445
Anyway, you don't seem
very enthusiastic

1064
01:14:26,523 --> 01:14:31,051
despite the fact that we're helping
with the investigation.

1065
01:14:31,962 --> 01:14:33,395
Enthusiasm?

1066
01:14:34,732 --> 01:14:37,895
I have none...
Actually, I'm depressed.

1067
01:14:38,368 --> 01:14:39,562
You're depressed?

1068
01:14:40,070 --> 01:14:40,866
Yes.

1069
01:14:42,272 --> 01:14:46,766
All this time.
I had thought that you were Kira.

1070
01:14:47,511 --> 01:14:50,480
I'm shocked that my deduction
was off...

1071
01:14:53,350 --> 01:14:54,476
Ryuzaki...

1072
01:14:55,018 --> 01:14:55,780
What?!

1073
01:15:09,433 --> 01:15:10,866
That hurt.

1074
01:15:11,368 --> 01:15:14,269
Stop messing around.
I wasn't Kira...

1075
01:15:14,338 --> 01:15:15,930
so you don't feel like
doing anything

1076
01:15:16,006 --> 01:15:17,439
because your deduction
was wrong?

1077
01:15:18,942 --> 01:15:21,137
I may have phrased that incorrectly.

1078
01:15:21,945 --> 01:15:23,606
It would be a waste for us
to make a move.

1079
01:15:23,680 --> 01:15:24,612
so we shouldn't...

1080
01:15:24,782 --> 01:15:26,374
There's no way
we can catch him

1081
01:15:26,450 --> 01:15:27,644
if we don't chase him!

1082
01:15:28,285 --> 01:15:29,809
Do you know how
many innocent people

1083
01:15:29,887 --> 01:15:31,320
you've involved in this case?!

1084
01:15:32,122 --> 01:15:35,023
Besides that, you're the one
that detained Misa and me!

1085
01:15:35,893 --> 01:15:41,297
I know...
But whatever your reasons...

1086
01:15:44,935 --> 01:15:46,664
It's an eye for an eye.

1087
01:15:49,039 --> 01:15:50,199
Oh?!

1088
01:16:01,785 --> 01:16:05,277
It's not that my deduction was wrong,
but the case isn't solved with

1089
01:16:05,355 --> 01:16:09,348
Light equals Kira and
Misa Amane equals Second Kira.

1090
01:16:10,194 --> 01:16:11,957
So I was a bit depressed.

1091
01:16:12,629 --> 01:16:14,654
Is it wrong for someone
to feel like that?

1092
01:16:15,165 --> 01:16:18,134
That's no good.
The way you talk...

1093
01:16:18,202 --> 01:16:21,638
It's as if you want me
to be Kira.

1094
01:16:22,606 --> 01:16:25,006
I want you to be Kira?

1095
01:16:26,043 --> 01:16:28,068
That may be true...

1096
01:16:29,213 --> 01:16:34,446
I just noticed... now...
I wanted you to be Kira...

1097
01:16:38,989 --> 01:16:44,985
It's an eye... for an eye.
I'm pretty strong.

1098
01:16:47,931 --> 01:16:49,922
L-Let's call the room
and stop them!

1099
01:16:53,003 --> 01:16:55,164
- Yes?
- Ryuzaki, listen to this.

1100
01:16:55,339 --> 01:16:59,173
Misa-Misa became number one
in Eighteen's reader popularity poll!

1101
01:16:59,810 --> 01:17:01,300
Yes, I see...

1102
01:17:01,578 --> 01:17:05,480
That means that she's the heroine
in the next Nishinaka film!

1103
01:17:06,650 --> 01:17:07,708
What's wrong?

1104
01:17:07,918 --> 01:17:09,886
Matsuda's acting stupid again.

1105
01:17:10,721 --> 01:17:13,155
Well, Matsuda is a natural at that.

1106
01:17:13,857 --> 01:17:15,222
I can hear you...

1107
01:17:22,866 --> 01:17:25,528
Ryuzaki, I'm sorry
you don't feel like doing anything,

1108
01:17:25,602 --> 01:17:26,899
but come over here for a second.

1109
01:17:27,638 --> 01:17:29,162
Take a good look at this.

1110
01:17:29,873 --> 01:17:30,965
Don't you think this is peculiar?

1111
01:17:32,209 --> 01:17:36,578
All three of them were
prominent Japanese businessmen.

1112
01:17:37,714 --> 01:17:39,978
They all died of heart attacks.

1113
01:17:40,817 --> 01:17:41,909
As a result,

1114
01:17:41,985 --> 01:17:45,011
Yotsuba's stock prices rose
and those of other companies dropped.

1115
01:17:45,989 --> 01:17:49,186
In other words, they're deaths
which are in Yotsuba's favor...

1116
01:17:49,393 --> 01:17:50,587
What do you think?

1117
01:17:50,894 --> 01:17:54,455
I don't think that Kira is
supporting Yotsuba, but...

1118
01:18:00,237 --> 01:18:02,000
It seems we're all here.

1119
01:18:02,272 --> 01:18:04,297
Then let's begin our regular meeting.

1120
01:18:04,775 --> 01:18:07,938
To further the growth of
the Yotsuba Group...

1121
01:18:08,011 --> 01:18:10,741
to become the biggest business
in the world...

1122
01:18:11,581 --> 01:18:13,139
Who should we kill?

1123
01:18:24,494 --> 01:18:25,620
Ryuzaki.

1124
01:18:25,696 --> 01:18:26,958
What is it. Watari?

1125
01:18:27,464 --> 01:18:32,060
Detective Eraldo Coil has received
a request to reveal L's identity.

1126
01:18:33,704 --> 01:18:35,171
Wasn't Eraldo Coil...

1127
01:18:35,238 --> 01:18:38,139
the man who's the
next greatest detective after L?

1128
01:18:38,809 --> 01:18:40,868
Who in the world would send
such a request?

1129
01:18:41,812 --> 01:18:44,872
The person who sent
in the request is...

1130
01:18:44,948 --> 01:18:46,313
Masahiko Kida. the head of

1131
01:18:46,383 --> 01:18:48,715
Yotsuba Group's Planning Department
in their Tokyo headquarters.

1132
01:18:48,885 --> 01:18:50,580
So it was Yotsuba!

1133
01:18:51,054 --> 01:18:53,352
That's not good.
We're short-handed.

1134
01:18:53,423 --> 01:18:56,256
We need to pay attention
to Coil. too?

1135
01:18:57,494 --> 01:19:02,329
It's all right. The detective known
as Eraldo Coil is me.

1136
01:19:03,800 --> 01:19:08,897
The world's three greatest detectives,
L. Coil. and Danuve...

1137
01:19:08,972 --> 01:19:10,337
are all me.

1138
01:19:10,841 --> 01:19:13,742
I'll give you this strawberry,
so keep it a secret.

1139
01:19:15,379 --> 01:19:17,006
You're really something, Ryuzaki.

1140
01:19:40,837 --> 01:19:43,067
Just watch me. Even I can be useful...

1141
01:19:52,249 --> 01:19:55,150
Okay. I just have to get close
to him, right?

1142
01:19:55,585 --> 01:19:56,677
Leave it to me.

1143
01:19:57,120 --> 01:19:58,781
And I just have to break

1144
01:19:58,855 --> 01:20:01,585
the surveillance cameras
and defense system...

1145
01:20:01,658 --> 01:20:05,424
of Yotsuba's Tokyo headquarters,
where this guy is.

1146
01:20:05,896 --> 01:20:07,022
Yes.

1147
01:20:07,097 --> 01:20:11,158
It is safe to assume that Kira and
Yotsuba are connected.

1148
01:20:11,735 --> 01:20:13,362
We're going to check Yotsuba

1149
01:20:13,437 --> 01:20:15,962
to see how many people
have special powers.

1150
01:20:16,039 --> 01:20:19,475
It is important that we have
a clear understanding.

1151
01:20:21,578 --> 01:20:24,046
Crap. I can't hear them clearly.

1152
01:20:24,514 --> 01:20:27,711
I've got to pick up something important...

1153
01:20:31,988 --> 01:20:33,546
He's just in the way.

1154
01:20:33,623 --> 01:20:35,250
Let's kill him and split up his stocks.

1155
01:20:35,325 --> 01:20:36,952
I just heard them say, "kill"!

1156
01:20:38,929 --> 01:20:40,794
Kira sure is varied.

1157
01:20:40,864 --> 01:20:41,660
Kira?!

1158
01:20:41,731 --> 01:20:44,165
There it is! Kira!
There it is! What?!

1159
01:20:44,234 --> 01:20:47,101
"Let's have Kira kill him"?!
I heard it!

1160
01:20:47,170 --> 01:20:49,331
They're really working with Kira...

1161
01:20:49,406 --> 01:20:51,704
I did it... I did a great job!

1162
01:21:01,017 --> 01:21:01,915
Who are you?!

1163
01:21:03,987 --> 01:21:07,320
If at all possible, do not do
anything hasty or impulsive.

1164
01:21:07,390 --> 01:21:09,688
Don't make any decisions
by yourself.

1165
01:21:10,760 --> 01:21:11,556
Ryuzaki...

1166
01:21:11,995 --> 01:21:13,087
What is it. Watari?

1167
01:21:13,730 --> 01:21:15,595
Mr. Matsuda has sent
an emergency signal

1168
01:21:15,665 --> 01:21:17,132
from his belt.

1169
01:21:18,301 --> 01:21:19,393
Where's it coming from?

1170
01:21:19,936 --> 01:21:20,960
Well. it seems...

1171
01:21:21,037 --> 01:21:24,131
it's coming from within
Yotsuba's Tokyo headquarters.

1172
01:21:24,941 --> 01:21:26,932
My name is Taro Matsui.

1173
01:21:27,010 --> 01:21:30,343
I'm a manager with
Yoshida Productions!

1174
01:21:30,413 --> 01:21:33,644
How would you like to use
our top multi-talented star, Misa Amane?

1175
01:21:33,717 --> 01:21:37,983
As the face of your company
and for your commercials?!

1176
01:21:39,623 --> 01:21:41,113
Matsuda, you idiot...

1177
01:21:50,367 --> 01:21:53,097
Light! Are you allowed to
go out with me today?

1178
01:21:53,170 --> 01:21:54,762
Along with Ryuzaki...

1179
01:21:55,505 --> 01:21:56,369
Misa...

1180
01:21:57,340 --> 01:21:59,433
Do you love Light?

1181
01:22:00,010 --> 01:22:00,942
Yes...

1182
01:22:01,011 --> 01:22:01,807
So...

1183
01:22:01,878 --> 01:22:04,438
Who would you pick, Light or Kira?

1184
01:22:04,581 --> 01:22:05,570
Huh?

1185
01:22:05,849 --> 01:22:07,976
Light, of course.

1186
01:22:08,051 --> 01:22:10,212
So would you want to be
of help to Light

1187
01:22:10,287 --> 01:22:13,620
and work with him
on the investigation?

1188
01:22:13,690 --> 01:22:14,657
R-Ryuzaki!

1189
01:22:14,724 --> 01:22:18,421
Yeah! I'll do anything for
Light's sake!

1190
01:22:18,595 --> 01:22:20,859
W-Wait a second.
What are you doing?

1191
01:22:21,765 --> 01:22:24,393
Right now, Matsuda has
been captured by Yotsuba.

1192
01:22:25,335 --> 01:22:27,269
Let's make use of the situation.

1193
01:22:28,205 --> 01:22:33,438
Misa will go to Yotsuba and
try to advertise herself.

1194
01:22:34,110 --> 01:22:37,204
We will get information
about Yotsuba from Misa.

1195
01:22:37,614 --> 01:22:39,104
She'll be our spy.

1196
01:22:39,316 --> 01:22:40,613
Yeah.

1197
01:22:40,784 --> 01:22:41,842
That's not good.

1198
01:22:41,985 --> 01:22:42,849
Why?

1199
01:22:42,919 --> 01:22:45,615
Because you'll be put in danger.

1200
01:22:46,756 --> 01:22:48,690
Are you worried about me?

1201
01:22:48,892 --> 01:22:49,881
Light.

1202
01:22:51,361 --> 01:22:55,593
If we win. Misa won't die. And...

1203
01:22:55,665 --> 01:22:59,328
as long as we're handcuffed,
we share the same fate.

1204
01:23:00,770 --> 01:23:02,135
Back to business...

1205
01:23:02,205 --> 01:23:04,196
Let's have Matsuda die.

1206
01:23:04,975 --> 01:23:06,806
Misa. head out.

1207
01:23:07,210 --> 01:23:08,268
Okay...

1208
01:23:09,212 --> 01:23:10,770
I'm Misa-Misa!

1209
01:23:10,847 --> 01:23:14,476
I won't go nude, but swimsuits
and underwear are okay!

1210
01:23:15,218 --> 01:23:16,947
Pleased to meet you!

1211
01:23:20,924 --> 01:23:23,324
She's really cute in person.

1212
01:23:23,793 --> 01:23:26,455
That's not the problem right now,
don't you think?

1213
01:23:30,100 --> 01:23:31,829
Yes. drink. drink.

1214
01:23:32,302 --> 01:23:33,599
This is heaven.

1215
01:23:35,071 --> 01:23:37,539
Misa's pretty good.

1216
01:23:43,847 --> 01:23:44,836
What's going on?!

1217
01:23:47,917 --> 01:23:50,750
Well... I sure am drunk.

1218
01:23:51,955 --> 01:23:54,219
Now, everyone...
the thing you've been waiting for!

1219
01:23:54,291 --> 01:23:57,419
The Taro Matsui Show!

1220
01:23:59,863 --> 01:24:01,763
Hey, what are you doing?

1221
01:24:03,500 --> 01:24:05,627
Matsui. do it!

1222
01:24:10,774 --> 01:24:13,470
Stop it! It's dangerous!
You idiot!

1223
01:24:13,643 --> 01:24:15,668
It's all right...

1224
01:24:35,332 --> 01:24:36,390
He fell!

1225
01:24:39,169 --> 01:24:40,431
This is bad...

1226
01:24:40,637 --> 01:24:42,502
Oh... no!

1227
01:24:42,572 --> 01:24:45,439
I came when I heard a thud.
How horrible!

1228
01:24:45,608 --> 01:24:48,372
- 119. 119!
- Honestly. What a horrid role.

1229
01:24:49,312 --> 01:24:52,679
Everyone,
leave this to us and go home.

1230
01:24:52,949 --> 01:24:54,314
Wha..? No way!

1231
01:24:54,617 --> 01:24:58,018
It's all right. Please consider
the advertisement offer.

1232
01:25:07,530 --> 01:25:11,728
Even if we're short of people,
I didn't want to have to do this.

1233
01:25:12,001 --> 01:25:13,992
Matsuda, you idiot...

1234
01:25:23,580 --> 01:25:25,070
Even though the meeting's over,

1235
01:25:25,148 --> 01:25:27,412
I still have to kill criminals
when I get home.

1236
01:25:27,984 --> 01:25:29,781
It sure is tough being Kira.

1237
01:25:30,620 --> 01:25:32,952
But it's getting interesting...

1238
01:25:33,857 --> 01:25:37,020
I'm going to make
Misa Amane my wife.

1239
01:25:43,066 --> 01:25:46,399
Money, power, and a beautiful wife...

1240
01:25:47,070 --> 01:25:49,800
People will be jealous of me...

1241
01:25:52,475 --> 01:25:53,999
Once we're married...

1242
01:25:54,077 --> 01:25:56,272
I'll put a lot of insurance money
on her...

1243
01:25:58,214 --> 01:26:00,978
Would she marry such
a crooked guy?

1244
01:26:06,289 --> 01:26:09,087
This is tiring...

1245
01:26:09,959 --> 01:26:12,757
But it's going well.
I've got to try hard...

1246
01:26:25,742 --> 01:26:28,506
Wh-What is this?!
A monster?

1247
01:26:29,212 --> 01:26:32,147
Misa, you're in a dangerous situation.

1248
01:26:32,215 --> 01:26:36,015
The Yotsuba workers
may kill you.

1249
01:26:36,553 --> 01:26:38,418
I came to tell you that.

1250
01:26:38,755 --> 01:26:40,382
Calm down and listen to me.

1251
01:26:40,790 --> 01:26:45,022
Calm down?
You look more like you would kill me!

1252
01:26:45,962 --> 01:26:48,021
I am your ally.

1253
01:26:48,264 --> 01:26:51,131
My... ally?

1254
01:26:56,673 --> 01:26:58,300
What are you?

1255
01:26:58,374 --> 01:27:03,107
I know you aren't a stalker,
but you don't look human at all...

1256
01:27:03,780 --> 01:27:06,874
Of course. I'm a Shinigami.

1257
01:27:08,518 --> 01:27:12,284
Misa, we once worked together.

1258
01:27:12,689 --> 01:27:15,214
I don't know what
you're talking about...

1259
01:27:16,359 --> 01:27:17,690
The Death Note...

1260
01:27:19,562 --> 01:27:25,831
If you write a person's name in it,
that person dies...

1261
01:27:27,070 --> 01:27:28,264
With that notebook.

1262
01:27:28,338 --> 01:27:33,901
Light Yagami punished criminals
and became known as Kira.

1263
01:27:37,247 --> 01:27:42,879
And you had the same...
no, greater power than Kira.

1264
01:27:43,853 --> 01:27:47,289
Light is Kira...
and I'm Second Kira?

1265
01:27:48,191 --> 01:27:50,625
Ryuzaki's correct.

1266
01:27:53,863 --> 01:27:55,854
When you go back...

1267
01:27:55,932 --> 01:27:58,765
you should be able
to tell who's Kira.

1268
01:27:59,269 --> 01:28:01,464
Be especially wary of him.

1269
01:28:02,839 --> 01:28:05,239
Sorry I took so long
in the restroom.

1270
01:28:05,475 --> 01:28:08,000
I fixed up my makeup.

1271
01:28:09,379 --> 01:28:11,904
Listen, when you return,

1272
01:28:11,981 --> 01:28:15,542
the man who's sitting
in front of me is Kira...

1273
01:28:15,952 --> 01:28:19,513
Rem... The person in front
of Rem is Kira...

1274
01:28:29,499 --> 01:28:31,160
Higuchi is Kira...

1275
01:28:31,601 --> 01:28:32,932
This is really bad...

1276
01:28:40,910 --> 01:28:42,571
Kyosuke Higuchi...

1277
01:28:43,146 --> 01:28:45,114
He's the dirty old man

1278
01:28:45,181 --> 01:28:48,844
who's been sending me
text messages.

1279
01:28:50,186 --> 01:28:53,815
It's really bad that this guy
is Kira...

1280
01:28:54,691 --> 01:28:55,817
Misa...

1281
01:28:56,092 --> 01:28:57,992
Shall we get something to eat?

1282
01:28:59,162 --> 01:29:02,359
Don't take me anywhere strange, okay?

1283
01:29:02,732 --> 01:29:04,962
Well, even if you do
something funny,

1284
01:29:05,034 --> 01:29:07,969
it's all right because
I can kill people.

1285
01:29:09,606 --> 01:29:11,733
What are you talking about, Misa?

1286
01:29:12,241 --> 01:29:15,404
Is this what Light Yagami
wants you to do?

1287
01:29:17,647 --> 01:29:19,945
You say such funny things, Misa.

1288
01:29:20,016 --> 01:29:21,506
You can kill people?

1289
01:29:21,818 --> 01:29:24,582
It's true. Because I'm...

1290
01:29:25,421 --> 01:29:26,911
The Second Kira.

1291
01:29:28,524 --> 01:29:31,550
It's my dream to become
Kira's bride.

1292
01:29:31,628 --> 01:29:34,153
Kira is sure to need me as well.

1293
01:29:35,431 --> 01:29:36,955
If she's the Second Kira...

1294
01:29:37,033 --> 01:29:38,830
then it's clear from
the Sakura TV incident

1295
01:29:38,901 --> 01:29:41,301
that she has the Shinigami eyes...

1296
01:29:41,604 --> 01:29:46,940
But if it is true,
I want to have her by my side.

1297
01:29:48,211 --> 01:29:49,610
I'll test her...

1298
01:29:52,582 --> 01:29:54,243
Ginzo Kaneboshi.

1299
01:29:54,317 --> 01:29:56,444
He's the president of
a major credit consumer business.

1300
01:29:56,519 --> 01:29:59,488
He's a crook who's famous
for his cruel collection methods.

1301
01:29:59,555 --> 01:30:02,023
Sometimes, he makes people
pay with insurance money.

1302
01:30:02,291 --> 01:30:03,485
How about him?

1303
01:30:03,559 --> 01:30:05,720
Can you find out immediately
if he died?

1304
01:30:06,029 --> 01:30:07,621
I can tell if I make a phone call.

1305
01:30:07,697 --> 01:30:10,029
Then turn around for a moment.

1306
01:30:14,637 --> 01:30:15,763
Misa...

1307
01:30:15,838 --> 01:30:18,739
I have to kill Ginzo Kaneboshi. don't I?

1308
01:30:19,275 --> 01:30:21,709
Higuchi will trust you if I do that...

1309
01:30:22,478 --> 01:30:23,536
Fine.

1310
01:30:24,781 --> 01:30:26,180
Ginzo Kaneboshi

1311
01:30:26,816 --> 01:30:28,716
All right. He's dead now.

1312
01:30:31,954 --> 01:30:33,421
This is Higuchi of Yotsuba.

1313
01:30:33,489 --> 01:30:35,923
Sorry! Our president just collapsed
and stopped breathing...

1314
01:30:35,992 --> 01:30:37,220
Call back later!

1315
01:30:43,933 --> 01:30:44,900
See?

1316
01:30:45,835 --> 01:30:49,737
She killed a person that
I chose right here...

1317
01:30:49,906 --> 01:30:53,364
It would have been impossible
unless she had powers!

1318
01:30:54,243 --> 01:30:55,574
It's decided!

1319
01:30:59,749 --> 01:31:02,377
I'm Kira, you'll marry me, right?!

1320
01:31:02,752 --> 01:31:04,185
Prove it.

1321
01:31:05,088 --> 01:31:07,716
I can't kill until I go home.

1322
01:31:07,890 --> 01:31:09,221
You understand.

1323
01:31:09,625 --> 01:31:12,093
Yeah... then it's no good.

1324
01:31:12,528 --> 01:31:15,827
It might be a scheme to
lure me into your house.

1325
01:31:17,133 --> 01:31:18,794
Oh. I know.

1326
01:31:19,869 --> 01:31:22,895
Then stop killing criminals.

1327
01:31:23,272 --> 01:31:25,297
If you're Kira,
I'm sure you can do it.

1328
01:31:25,875 --> 01:31:29,504
Then begin killing when
I tell you to.

1329
01:31:29,579 --> 01:31:31,046
Then I'll believe you.

1330
01:31:31,380 --> 01:31:35,578
Killing criminals is something
that only Kira could do.

1331
01:31:36,519 --> 01:31:38,612
I see. That's a good idea.

1332
01:31:40,256 --> 01:31:41,245
All right.

1333
01:31:41,524 --> 01:31:45,051
I'm Kira, so in order to
make you trust me,

1334
01:31:45,128 --> 01:31:47,562
I'm going to stop killing criminals
from now.

1335
01:31:47,630 --> 01:31:51,293
And when you know I'm Kira,
we'll get married!

1336
01:31:53,503 --> 01:31:55,232
And so...

1337
01:31:56,172 --> 01:31:57,571
Higuchi is Kira!

1338
01:32:13,689 --> 01:32:16,317
It's been three days since
I stopped killing criminals.

1339
01:32:16,392 --> 01:32:18,019
That's good enough, isn't it?

1340
01:32:19,028 --> 01:32:22,589
Now, if I marry the Second Kira,
Misa Amane...

1341
01:32:23,032 --> 01:32:29,437
I'll get the Shinigami eyes.
And I'll control Yotsuba!

1342
01:32:38,281 --> 01:32:39,612
Higuchi, this is bad.

1343
01:32:39,682 --> 01:32:42,082
Turn on your TV to Sakura TV.

1344
01:32:44,821 --> 01:32:47,619
So one of these people
is Kira, right?

1345
01:32:47,790 --> 01:32:50,520
Yes. I have a lot of proof.

1346
01:32:50,693 --> 01:32:51,990
What is this?

1347
01:32:52,061 --> 01:32:55,121
It's probably a hoax.
It's Sakura TV.

1348
01:32:55,331 --> 01:32:57,060
At the beginning of the program,

1349
01:32:57,133 --> 01:33:00,500
he said that he came across
a meeting of eight people.

1350
01:33:05,541 --> 01:33:06,906
I-It's him!

1351
01:33:10,479 --> 01:33:11,673
Misa's manager...

1352
01:33:11,747 --> 01:33:14,614
I think his name was Matsui!
Why is he alive?!

1353
01:33:16,419 --> 01:33:17,477
Are you all right?

1354
01:33:17,553 --> 01:33:18,679
Shall we stop?

1355
01:33:19,455 --> 01:33:22,288
No... I'm well aware of the danger...

1356
01:33:22,358 --> 01:33:24,656
Even if I'm killed, I shall fight on...

1357
01:33:24,727 --> 01:33:26,627
until the end in the name
of justice.

1358
01:33:26,963 --> 01:33:28,931
That's good. That's good.

1359
01:33:29,298 --> 01:33:31,198
Don't make
the Kira announcement

1360
01:33:31,267 --> 01:33:33,394
until the end of the program.

1361
01:33:33,636 --> 01:33:34,603
This is bad.

1362
01:33:34,670 --> 01:33:36,763
- I don't know when he'll expose me.
- The announcement will come soon.

1363
01:33:36,839 --> 01:33:38,329
Don't change your channel.

1364
01:33:40,109 --> 01:33:41,599
Cosme Misa.

1365
01:33:41,677 --> 01:33:44,168
A devilish charm...
An angel's glitter...

1366
01:33:44,247 --> 01:33:45,544
Misa's winning rouge...

1367
01:33:45,715 --> 01:33:47,046
Mido. it's me.

1368
01:33:47,116 --> 01:33:48,583
Something bad is happening
on Sakura TV.

1369
01:33:48,951 --> 01:33:51,181
Get your father in
the House of Councilors and

1370
01:33:51,254 --> 01:33:54,485
have the Ministry of Public Management
stop the program.

1371
01:33:55,224 --> 01:33:57,419
I'm watching,
but that's impossible.

1372
01:33:57,627 --> 01:34:01,290
No one trusts this program
and is suspicious of it.

1373
01:34:02,365 --> 01:34:04,925
Besides, there's nothing
to fear any more.

1374
01:34:05,101 --> 01:34:07,001
That guy revealed his face...

1375
01:34:07,069 --> 01:34:09,663
We can confirm that
it's Taro Matsui.

1376
01:34:10,373 --> 01:34:13,274
Namikawa is telling everyone
to watch this show.

1377
01:34:14,744 --> 01:34:16,974
One of the seven of us is Kira.

1378
01:34:17,046 --> 01:34:19,105
Soon. Taro Matsui will die.

1379
01:34:20,182 --> 01:34:23,117
I see. I'm the only one
who knows

1380
01:34:23,185 --> 01:34:25,881
that Taro Matsui is not
his real name, so...

1381
01:34:26,923 --> 01:34:30,086
If I say that,
then I'll reveal that I'm Kira.

1382
01:34:32,728 --> 01:34:35,253
- You're right. Talk to you later.
- Kira will be revealed shortly!

1383
01:34:36,499 --> 01:34:38,091
Stay with us!

1384
01:34:38,868 --> 01:34:41,428
If he's going to say it at
the end of the program,

1385
01:34:41,504 --> 01:34:43,131
I still have two hours...

1386
01:34:54,850 --> 01:34:57,648
I've confirmed Higuchi.
He's only got a bag on him.

1387
01:34:58,020 --> 01:34:58,850
I'm going after him.

1388
01:35:02,658 --> 01:35:04,785
Everything's going according
to plan, isn't it?

1389
01:35:05,161 --> 01:35:06,093
Yes.

1390
01:35:47,136 --> 01:35:48,103
Taichiro Yamashita

1391
01:35:48,804 --> 01:35:52,262
Now, how are you going to kill?
Show me!

1392
01:35:55,978 --> 01:35:58,412
Taichiro Yamashita

1393
01:36:04,520 --> 01:36:05,384
It's no good.

1394
01:36:05,454 --> 01:36:07,285
He just made a note of his name
and is leaving.

1395
01:36:07,356 --> 01:36:08,846
He's not going to kill him here?

1396
01:36:09,492 --> 01:36:11,119
Ryuzaki! Shall I restrain him?

1397
01:36:11,694 --> 01:36:13,992
I still don't know how he kills.

1398
01:36:14,296 --> 01:36:17,322
He might do something in his car.

1399
01:36:17,833 --> 01:36:19,664
Turn monitor one to Higuchi's car.

1400
01:36:24,673 --> 01:36:26,300
Higuchi is awfully calm

1401
01:36:26,375 --> 01:36:29,310
despite wanting to kill Matsuda
as soon as possible...

1402
01:36:30,146 --> 01:36:32,376
36... 37...

1403
01:36:32,448 --> 01:36:34,848
38... 39...

1404
01:36:35,251 --> 01:36:36,582
40 seconds...

1405
01:36:37,420 --> 01:36:41,186
Kira is a murderer,
so I won't forgive him.

1406
01:36:42,291 --> 01:36:44,020
Crap! He won't die!

1407
01:36:44,326 --> 01:36:45,520
What's the meaning of this?!

1408
01:36:45,594 --> 01:36:46,959
He said. "He won't die!"

1409
01:36:47,430 --> 01:36:49,227
Did he try to kill him already?

1410
01:36:49,965 --> 01:36:52,297
Is writing his name all he has to do?

1411
01:36:59,241 --> 01:37:01,175
Rem. Let's bargain.

1412
01:37:02,311 --> 01:37:03,437
Bargain?

1413
01:37:03,612 --> 01:37:06,945
Could Kira's power be
from heaven or something?

1414
01:37:07,483 --> 01:37:10,213
At any rate, we should watch him.

1415
01:37:13,255 --> 01:37:15,587
Now I'm unstoppable...

1416
01:37:15,658 --> 01:37:17,922
With this, I have unlimited options.

1417
01:37:21,297 --> 01:37:22,161
I'm going after him!

1418
01:37:28,504 --> 01:37:32,497
Stop the Porsche.
Pull over to the side of the road.

1419
01:37:37,213 --> 01:37:38,237
This is bad.

1420
01:37:38,380 --> 01:37:40,405
Higuchi has been caught
by a motorcycle policeman.

1421
01:37:40,716 --> 01:37:42,980
You were speeding.
Show me your driver's license!

1422
01:37:43,352 --> 01:37:45,115
Yeah... all right.

1423
01:37:45,354 --> 01:37:47,345
All screens on Higuchi's car...

1424
01:37:48,023 --> 01:37:50,924
Where did I put my license...

1425
01:37:53,095 --> 01:37:55,154
I have no time
to be sticking around here.

1426
01:37:57,733 --> 01:37:58,700
H-Hey!

1427
01:37:58,868 --> 01:38:00,699
Higuchi has ditched
the motorcycle policeman and is escaping!

1428
01:38:02,204 --> 01:38:03,637
This is traffic riot squad...

1429
01:38:09,879 --> 01:38:12,074
Th-The motorcycle policeman
rear-ended a truck!

1430
01:38:12,148 --> 01:38:12,910
It's a collision!

1431
01:38:13,182 --> 01:38:14,979
A collision?!
An accidental death?

1432
01:38:15,217 --> 01:38:16,650
This is bad.

1433
01:38:16,785 --> 01:38:18,252
No, that aside,

1434
01:38:18,320 --> 01:38:20,982
how did he obtain the name
of that motorcycle policeman?

1435
01:38:21,590 --> 01:38:24,354
Could it be that he killed him
by looking at his face like Second Kira?

1436
01:38:25,161 --> 01:38:27,095
Rem... Bargain...

1437
01:38:27,530 --> 01:38:30,727
No... If he could kill just by
looking at someone's face...

1438
01:38:30,799 --> 01:38:33,563
he would have killed
Matsuda already.

1439
01:38:33,769 --> 01:38:36,169
What's going on? But...

1440
01:38:36,572 --> 01:38:37,596
Everyone!

1441
01:38:37,673 --> 01:38:40,471
It's too dangerous to leave
Higuchi alone any longer.

1442
01:38:40,543 --> 01:38:42,033
We will proceed to capture him.

1443
01:38:42,444 --> 01:38:44,935
Higuchi is now able to kill
by looking at someone's face,

1444
01:38:45,014 --> 01:38:46,743
like Second Kira.

1445
01:38:47,716 --> 01:38:49,809
We will capture him with
that in mind!

1446
01:38:50,786 --> 01:38:52,014
This is L.

1447
01:38:52,087 --> 01:38:54,282
We have narrowed down
Kira to a single person.

1448
01:38:54,790 --> 01:38:56,781
Currently, he's heading
from Hibiya to Shibuya

1449
01:38:56,859 --> 01:39:00,488
on highway Route One
in a red Porsche 911.

1450
01:39:00,963 --> 01:39:02,794
We shall capture him.

1451
01:39:02,865 --> 01:39:06,995
Instruct all officers
not to approach that Porsche.

1452
01:39:07,803 --> 01:39:11,102
Dad. after the next commercial.
take measure seven.

1453
01:39:11,340 --> 01:39:12,307
Got it.

1454
01:39:12,708 --> 01:39:15,472
Then Yagami, shall we go?

1455
01:39:15,844 --> 01:39:16,776
Yeah.

1456
01:39:19,615 --> 01:39:20,741
Dad...

1457
01:39:20,816 --> 01:39:23,284
Higuchi is almost at Sakura TV.

1458
01:39:23,652 --> 01:39:25,142
He'll be there in less than
fifteen minutes.

1459
01:39:25,387 --> 01:39:26,479
Are you all right?

1460
01:39:27,022 --> 01:39:29,513
I don't want my son
asking me if I'm all right.

1461
01:39:29,959 --> 01:39:31,187
I'm all right, Light.

1462
01:39:31,927 --> 01:39:33,326
We're getting lots of...

1463
01:39:33,395 --> 01:39:36,831
phone calls and faxes
showing support...

1464
01:39:36,899 --> 01:39:40,460
for you, the brave witness.

1465
01:39:43,239 --> 01:39:44,797
I'm very sorry...

1466
01:39:44,907 --> 01:39:45,703
What?!

1467
01:39:45,774 --> 01:39:47,366
But due to circumstances,

1468
01:39:47,443 --> 01:39:49,604
- we will end the program here.
- A mannequin?! No way!

1469
01:39:50,312 --> 01:39:51,711
Stop right there, Higuchi!

1470
01:39:52,281 --> 01:39:53,145
Don't move!

1471
01:39:58,587 --> 01:40:00,111
Give up.

1472
01:40:01,056 --> 01:40:03,889
Y-You must be making
some kind of mistake.

1473
01:40:04,126 --> 01:40:07,152
I had something I wanted to
talk to Demegawa about...

1474
01:40:07,429 --> 01:40:09,158
I'll show you my card...

1475
01:40:14,770 --> 01:40:15,634
Bureau Chief!

1476
01:40:17,840 --> 01:40:20,673
Higuchi has a gun!
The Bureau Chief has been shot.

1477
01:40:20,976 --> 01:40:22,238
Higuchi is getting away!

1478
01:40:22,378 --> 01:40:23,345
I'm all right.

1479
01:40:23,646 --> 01:40:24,977
We have no choice.

1480
01:40:25,047 --> 01:40:27,413
We shall proceed to
capture him as well.

1481
01:40:27,850 --> 01:40:29,579
Watari, are you ready?

1482
01:40:30,085 --> 01:40:30,744
Yes...

1483
01:41:14,797 --> 01:41:15,957
That's as far as you're going.

1484
01:41:22,671 --> 01:41:25,401
Don't come any closer!
Nobody come near me!

1485
01:41:34,983 --> 01:41:35,972
It's over...

1486
01:41:37,553 --> 01:41:38,451
Yes. it is...

1487
01:42:00,409 --> 01:42:04,709
Higuchi... How do you kill people?

1488
01:42:10,452 --> 01:42:11,783
The notebook.

1489
01:42:12,020 --> 01:42:13,044
Notebook?

1490
01:42:13,589 --> 01:42:16,752
You may not believe me,
but if I write the name

1491
01:42:16,825 --> 01:42:18,850
of someone whose face
I know in that notebook.

1492
01:42:18,927 --> 01:42:20,360
that person will die.

1493
01:42:21,497 --> 01:42:22,521
Notebook...

1494
01:42:23,399 --> 01:42:24,331
Yagami.

1495
01:42:24,666 --> 01:42:27,829
Yeah, there is one in Higuchi's bag.

1496
01:42:28,670 --> 01:42:31,366
It has names in it.

1497
01:42:31,440 --> 01:42:33,135
but it looks like
any other notebook...

1498
01:42:36,845 --> 01:42:38,073
What's wrong, Dad?

1499
01:42:38,313 --> 01:42:40,406
Oh... uh...

1500
01:42:40,482 --> 01:42:43,349
I-It seems only people who have touched
this notebook can see this...

1501
01:42:44,386 --> 01:42:45,683
T-This monster!

1502
01:42:55,564 --> 01:42:57,964
It's a Shinigami... isn't it?

1503
01:42:58,467 --> 01:43:02,233
They... really... do... exist...

1504
01:43:02,671 --> 01:43:05,071
Light Yagami... Amane...
May 22, Aoyama...

1505
01:43:05,441 --> 01:43:07,932
Show notebooks. Love at first sight.
Second Kira...

1506
01:43:08,010 --> 01:43:09,568
Ryuzaki, let me see the notebook.

1507
01:43:09,645 --> 01:43:12,409
Method of killing.
Kira... Second... Two!

1508
01:43:13,816 --> 01:43:16,341
There are more than
two notebooks in existence!

1509
01:43:16,952 --> 01:43:18,385
This isn't over yet...

1510
01:43:35,404 --> 01:43:36,371
I am L.

1511
01:43:38,941 --> 01:43:40,340
I am L.

1512
01:43:48,016 --> 01:43:49,847
A-Are you all right?

1513
01:43:50,853 --> 01:43:53,048
Anyone would be surprised
by that monster...

1514
01:43:54,356 --> 01:43:55,288
Ryuzaki.

1515
01:43:55,724 --> 01:43:56,554
Yes?

1516
01:43:57,326 --> 01:43:59,419
I'm going to cross-check
the names written in here...

1517
01:43:59,495 --> 01:44:01,827
with the names of the victims.

1518
01:44:02,664 --> 01:44:06,623
Huh? Yes...
Well, you're right.

1519
01:44:12,975 --> 01:44:14,169
I've won!

1520
01:44:16,345 --> 01:44:18,074
It's just as I planned.

1521
01:44:21,116 --> 01:44:22,105
Higuchi?!

1522
01:44:22,184 --> 01:44:23,549
Ryuzaki, Higuchi is!

1523
01:44:23,986 --> 01:44:25,681
Wh-What's this?!
What's going on?!

1524
01:44:27,956 --> 01:44:29,218
Hey, Higuchi!

1525
01:44:29,458 --> 01:44:31,824
Wh-What are you doing, Dad?!

1526
01:44:32,160 --> 01:44:34,526
If Higuchi dies, now...

1527
01:44:34,963 --> 01:44:36,590
I-It can't be..!

1528
01:44:36,765 --> 01:44:39,529
No, but, he's already...

1529
01:44:41,803 --> 01:44:43,930
Yeah, he's dead.

1530
01:44:45,207 --> 01:44:46,469
You're next...

1531
01:44:48,410 --> 01:44:49,707
Ryuzaki.

1532
01:45:15,871 --> 01:45:17,896
Light, I remember.

1533
01:45:17,973 --> 01:45:20,441
I remember all about
when I used this notebook.

1534
01:45:26,748 --> 01:45:29,979
Misa, your memory
should have returned

1535
01:45:30,052 --> 01:45:32,077
when you read this message.

1536
01:45:32,788 --> 01:45:34,415
A letter from Light!

1537
01:45:35,791 --> 01:45:38,726
Do you remember
my friend at To-Oh University

1538
01:45:38,794 --> 01:45:40,591
who went by the name
Hideki Ryuga?

1539
01:45:41,196 --> 01:45:44,791
I want you to write his name
in the notebook and kill him.

1540
01:45:45,267 --> 01:45:47,201
Burn this letter.

1541
01:45:47,336 --> 01:45:49,770
Hide a few pages of
the notebook with you...

1542
01:45:49,972 --> 01:45:51,963
And bury the notebook.

1543
01:45:53,008 --> 01:45:54,999
When you meet me again,

1544
01:45:55,077 --> 01:45:57,773
let me touch a clipping of
the notebook in a natural way.

1545
01:45:58,246 --> 01:45:59,873
If you do this,

1546
01:45:59,948 --> 01:46:03,645
I'll love you for
the rest of my life.

1547
01:46:04,219 --> 01:46:05,186
All right!

1548
01:46:06,054 --> 01:46:08,454
I see. This is Light's plan!

1549
01:46:08,890 --> 01:46:11,950
He wanted me to get this notebook,
regain my memory...

1550
01:46:13,095 --> 01:46:16,030
And kill Hideki Ryuga...
Ryuzaki...

1551
01:46:17,833 --> 01:46:20,199
One of Light's obstacles
has disappeared

1552
01:46:20,268 --> 01:46:22,361
and I can help him.

1553
01:46:25,841 --> 01:46:27,832
It's no good... Light...

1554
01:46:28,777 --> 01:46:30,836
I can't remember his name.

1555
01:46:31,747 --> 01:46:36,377
I've seen dozens and hundreds
of names and life spans...

1556
01:46:38,920 --> 01:46:41,889
I just can't remember!
I'm so stupid!

1557
01:46:45,260 --> 01:46:47,319
I can finally come back.

1558
01:46:47,929 --> 01:46:49,055
Ryuk!

1559
01:46:49,131 --> 01:46:51,224
It's been a while...
How are you?

1560
01:46:52,467 --> 01:46:53,491
Sorry, but...

1561
01:46:56,672 --> 01:46:59,368
I'm still male.
You're making me bashful.

1562
01:47:01,009 --> 01:47:03,341
It looks like things went well.

1563
01:47:03,945 --> 01:47:06,539
He planned to relinquish ownership
of the notebook.

1564
01:47:06,615 --> 01:47:09,550
lose his memory and
regain it once more

1565
01:47:09,618 --> 01:47:12,416
by touching the notebook...

1566
01:47:13,922 --> 01:47:17,016
Rem would haunt someone else...
and wait for Light to find her.

1567
01:47:17,092 --> 01:47:20,118
For Light to find her...

1568
01:47:21,897 --> 01:47:25,890
The police have seen
the notebook

1569
01:47:25,967 --> 01:47:29,300
and the fake rules that
Light had me write.

1570
01:47:29,371 --> 01:47:31,100
They're pouring over them
right now...

1571
01:47:32,674 --> 01:47:33,902
Now. Rem...

1572
01:47:34,676 --> 01:47:37,543
Whoever writes a name
in the notebook will die

1573
01:47:37,612 --> 01:47:40,012
unless he writes another name
in the notebook

1574
01:47:40,082 --> 01:47:42,209
within 13 days, right?

1575
01:47:44,853 --> 01:47:45,615
Wha..?

1576
01:47:45,921 --> 01:47:47,013
Which means that...

1577
01:47:47,089 --> 01:47:50,456
Light and Misa-Misa are
completely cleared!

1578
01:47:50,692 --> 01:47:52,284
Yes. indeed...

1579
01:47:52,728 --> 01:47:54,958
Light and Amane were detained
for more than fifty days

1580
01:47:55,030 --> 01:47:57,123
and are still under surveillance...

1581
01:47:57,999 --> 01:48:00,729
There's no way they'd still
be alive if they're both Kira.

1582
01:48:02,537 --> 01:48:06,769
Light pulled it off really well...

1583
01:48:07,509 --> 01:48:08,737
Oh yeah...

1584
01:48:09,211 --> 01:48:09,870
Here.

1585
01:48:10,912 --> 01:48:12,539
Light told me to bring this.

1586
01:48:15,183 --> 01:48:16,844
Is it really that delicious?

1587
01:48:16,985 --> 01:48:20,284
Yeah. Apples of the Human World
are juicy..?

1588
01:48:20,355 --> 01:48:22,585
Is that what you'd say?
At any rate, they're great.

1589
01:48:24,292 --> 01:48:25,782
Do you want to eat?

1590
01:48:27,095 --> 01:48:29,256
It's an apple from the Shinigami World.

1591
01:48:31,566 --> 01:48:33,534
It doesn't look very good...

1592
01:48:33,602 --> 01:48:35,092
Come on, just one bite.

1593
01:48:37,205 --> 01:48:38,934
Oh yeah, Ryuk...

1594
01:48:39,207 --> 01:48:41,232
Do the eye bargain with me.

1595
01:48:45,547 --> 01:48:46,980
Sand!

1596
01:48:52,654 --> 01:48:54,019
A bargain, huh?

1597
01:48:56,057 --> 01:48:57,547
You understand, don't you?

1598
01:48:58,026 --> 01:49:01,154
You've made a bargain
with Rem once before.

1599
01:49:01,329 --> 01:49:05,959
Do you really want to halve
your life a second time?

1600
01:49:07,169 --> 01:49:09,228
Well, that can't be helped...

1601
01:49:09,771 --> 01:49:13,400
I've forgotten the name
I had to remember...

1602
01:49:13,475 --> 01:49:16,603
Light will be angry with me
if I don't take a look at it again.

1603
01:49:18,213 --> 01:49:20,306
Well, I'm okay with that...

1604
01:49:27,489 --> 01:49:28,922
Oh. it's Misa-Misa.

1605
01:49:29,224 --> 01:49:30,248
Ryuk!

1606
01:49:30,759 --> 01:49:32,727
Why is he haunting Misa?

1607
01:49:37,065 --> 01:49:40,125
Misa's life has been halved
once more!

1608
01:49:40,435 --> 01:49:43,495
Did she... do the eye bargain with Ryuk?!

1609
01:49:46,308 --> 01:49:47,332
Light...

1610
01:49:52,881 --> 01:49:54,746
It's been a while, Ryuk.

1611
01:50:06,061 --> 01:50:08,996
Misa, right now,
I feel like living with you

1612
01:50:09,064 --> 01:50:12,227
in my ideal new world for
a long, long time.

1613
01:50:12,767 --> 01:50:14,564
Light, I'm so happy!

1614
01:50:15,170 --> 01:50:18,367
Misa. let's make
a new crimeless world together.

1615
01:50:18,440 --> 01:50:21,432
One with only kind and
innocent people in it.

1616
01:50:21,943 --> 01:50:22,967
Yeah!

1617
01:50:40,462 --> 01:50:42,896
What's wrong, Ryuzaki?

1618
01:50:51,239 --> 01:50:52,365
What's wrong?

1619
01:51:53,835 --> 01:51:56,963
âª Careful

1620
01:51:57,906 --> 01:52:01,808
âª God is watching.

1621
01:52:02,444 --> 01:52:10,510
âª Please hold my hand
on dark nights.

1622
01:52:11,052 --> 01:52:14,954
âª Even if you're far away
by yourself.

1623
01:52:15,256 --> 01:52:21,491
âª You always find me...

1624
01:52:21,696 --> 01:52:29,125
âª You tell me everything
you know.

1625
01:52:30,305 --> 01:52:34,833
âª Even if I don't remember...

1626
01:52:34,909 --> 01:52:44,216
âª You tell me many times.

1627
01:52:48,189 --> 01:53:01,728
âª But what do I do once
I know everything?

1628
01:53:08,843 --> 01:53:10,105
What do you mean?

1629
01:53:10,879 --> 01:53:12,608
Criminals are dying again?!

1630
01:53:13,014 --> 01:53:14,811
There were fourteen
just yesterday.

1631
01:53:15,116 --> 01:53:17,380
They were broadcast
after Higuchi died...

1632
01:53:17,752 --> 01:53:19,413
Immediately, huh?

1633
01:53:19,754 --> 01:53:23,246
I guess that means that Higuchi
wasn't necessarily Kira...

1634
01:53:23,525 --> 01:53:26,494
No. We're positive that Higuchi
was the one killing criminals

1635
01:53:26,561 --> 01:53:28,222
until we caught him.

1636
01:53:28,396 --> 01:53:31,456
Then does that mean that
another Kira has appeared?

1637
01:53:31,900 --> 01:53:34,698
Oh... why?!

1638
01:53:34,769 --> 01:53:36,999
Crap... curse you, Kira...

1639
01:53:37,639 --> 01:53:40,403
Kira appears now...
What's going on?

1640
01:53:41,910 --> 01:53:43,468
Oh no...

1641
01:53:44,512 --> 01:53:46,036
There's only Misa...

1642
01:53:46,848 --> 01:53:49,339
This happened as soon
as Amane was freed. didn't it?

1643
01:53:49,617 --> 01:53:51,778
Ryuzaki, are you still saying that?

1644
01:53:52,187 --> 01:53:53,586
Misa is not involved.

1645
01:53:54,355 --> 01:53:56,880
It happened as soon
as Higuchi died.

1646
01:53:57,692 --> 01:53:58,989
You're right...

1647
01:54:00,962 --> 01:54:06,059
Well. if there is another notebook
and someone is using it...

1648
01:54:08,036 --> 01:54:10,470
I'll catch him.

1649
01:54:16,845 --> 01:54:19,336
The Shinigami told me
he doesn't know, but...

1650
01:54:20,014 --> 01:54:21,447
If someone can kill

1651
01:54:21,516 --> 01:54:24,349
by writing a name on
a clipping from the notebook...

1652
01:54:27,755 --> 01:54:29,347
It's not impossible...

1653
01:54:30,091 --> 01:54:33,754
But... whoever writes
a name in this notebook...

1654
01:54:33,962 --> 01:54:37,489
has to write another name
within thirteen days or die...

1655
01:54:38,800 --> 01:54:41,633
Light Yagami and Misa Amane
are living...

1656
01:54:42,604 --> 01:54:45,801
Thirteen days...
It's only that fact...

1657
01:54:47,675 --> 01:54:49,836
Ryuzaki, even if we do
catch the person

1658
01:54:49,911 --> 01:54:51,970
who was writing in the notebook...

1659
01:54:52,514 --> 01:54:56,848
Can we really convict and
punish him for mass murder?

1660
01:54:57,085 --> 01:54:59,781
Of course we can!

1661
01:54:59,854 --> 01:55:03,756
He wrote countless names
knowing that people would die.

1662
01:55:03,892 --> 01:55:05,484
We should kill him

1663
01:55:05,560 --> 01:55:07,994
if we don't want the existence
of the notebook to go public.

1664
01:55:08,963 --> 01:55:11,261
Killing him isn't a very
level-headed reaction.

1665
01:55:11,332 --> 01:55:14,028
but our superiors would probably
take measures like that.

1666
01:55:14,702 --> 01:55:16,169
If he admits to killing
with the notebook.

1667
01:55:16,237 --> 01:55:17,795
he would receive
the death penalty.

1668
01:55:17,872 --> 01:55:19,601
Or at least a life sentence.

1669
01:55:21,609 --> 01:55:23,338
Something like that.

1670
01:55:23,912 --> 01:55:26,779
What are you thinking,
Light Yagami?

1671
01:55:27,482 --> 01:55:29,848
If Misa is caught,
you'd be caught too...

1672
01:55:32,153 --> 01:55:36,419
So that's it!
What a bastard!

1673
01:55:38,259 --> 01:55:43,561
Light Yagami is sure that
I'll save Misa's life...

1674
01:55:44,098 --> 01:55:46,532
In order to save Misa
in this situation,

1675
01:55:46,601 --> 01:55:50,833
I have to write Ryuzaki's real name
in my notebook...

1676
01:55:51,406 --> 01:55:54,341
And if I kill Ryuzaki...

1677
01:55:56,444 --> 01:56:01,108
It'll be something related to
Misa's life and I'll die as well...

1678
01:56:01,616 --> 01:56:05,814
Light Yagami is making
everything go his way...

1679
01:56:08,656 --> 01:56:09,953
What are you going to do, Rem?

1680
01:56:10,325 --> 01:56:13,317
I know full well that
despite being a Shinigami,

1681
01:56:13,394 --> 01:56:15,089
you're infatuated with Misa.

1682
01:56:16,164 --> 01:56:18,655
Misa's life has been
halved once more.

1683
01:56:18,733 --> 01:56:20,701
There's no way
you'd leave her alone.

1684
01:56:21,369 --> 01:56:23,462
Think about Misa's happiness.

1685
01:56:58,506 --> 01:57:01,236
What are you doing there, Ryuzaki?

1686
01:57:06,381 --> 01:57:09,214
What are you doing there, Ryuzaki?!

1687
01:57:22,163 --> 01:57:23,994
What are you doing, Ryuzaki?

1688
01:57:24,666 --> 01:57:27,965
No... I'm not doing anything
in particular, but...

1689
01:57:29,370 --> 01:57:30,803
The sound of the bells...

1690
01:57:31,539 --> 01:57:32,767
Bells?

1691
01:57:33,341 --> 01:57:34,569
Yes.

1692
01:57:34,809 --> 01:57:37,835
I've been hearing noisy bells
throughout the day...

1693
01:57:42,016 --> 01:57:43,677
I don't hear anything.

1694
01:57:44,385 --> 01:57:48,685
Really? They've been ringing
all day and...

1695
01:57:48,756 --> 01:57:51,088
I can't help but be curious...

1696
01:57:52,060 --> 01:57:54,927
Do you suppose it's a church?
A wedding?

1697
01:57:55,763 --> 01:57:58,288
- Or perhaps...
- What are you talking about, Ryuzaki?

1698
01:57:58,666 --> 01:58:01,191
Don't say silly things.
Let's go back.

1699
01:58:02,704 --> 01:58:04,103
Sorry.

1700
01:58:05,139 --> 01:58:07,972
Everything I say is a lie, so...

1701
01:58:08,142 --> 01:58:10,076
Don't believe any of it.

1702
01:58:19,253 --> 01:58:20,652
That's right, Ryuzaki.

1703
01:58:21,389 --> 01:58:23,949
Most of what you say is a lie.

1704
01:58:24,392 --> 01:58:27,259
There would be no end if
I took you seriously all the time.

1705
01:58:27,528 --> 01:58:30,122
I know that very well.

1706
01:58:31,099 --> 01:58:34,068
Yes, that's right, Light.

1707
01:58:36,304 --> 01:58:39,831
But... it's true for both of us.

1708
01:58:41,642 --> 01:58:42,973
What do you mean?

1709
01:58:44,846 --> 01:58:49,806
Have you ever told the truth
at any point since you were born?

1710
01:58:56,224 --> 01:58:58,192
What are you talking about, Ryuzaki?

1711
01:58:58,760 --> 01:59:00,955
It's true that I lie once
in a while.

1712
01:59:01,696 --> 01:59:05,427
But how many people live
their entire lives

1713
01:59:05,500 --> 01:59:07,058
only telling the truth?

1714
01:59:08,302 --> 01:59:11,135
Humans aren't perfect.

1715
01:59:11,572 --> 01:59:15,008
Everyone lies. Even so...

1716
01:59:15,376 --> 01:59:19,335
I've tried not to tell lies
that hurt others.

1717
01:59:19,981 --> 01:59:21,471
That's my answer.

1718
01:59:25,186 --> 01:59:26,983
I thought you'd say that.

1719
01:59:40,301 --> 01:59:43,202
Oh, Ryuzaki!
What is the meaning of this?!

1720
01:59:43,371 --> 01:59:45,134
I heard that you got an approval
from a certain country

1721
01:59:45,206 --> 01:59:46,833
to use the notebook for
an execution!

1722
01:59:47,275 --> 01:59:49,709
Watari...
Good work.

1723
01:59:49,944 --> 01:59:52,071
- You're welcome.
- Right off...

1724
01:59:52,380 --> 01:59:54,974
Make arrangements
to transport the notebook.

1725
01:59:55,183 --> 01:59:56,480
Yes.

1726
01:59:56,551 --> 01:59:58,382
Ryuzaki, what's the meaning
of this?

1727
01:59:59,420 --> 02:00:01,820
It means that I'm going to
try out the notebook for real.

1728
02:00:03,458 --> 02:00:05,926
That's pointless.
We don't have to do that.

1729
02:00:06,160 --> 02:00:08,390
We already know that the power
of the notebook is real. don't we?

1730
02:00:08,496 --> 02:00:10,794
Besides, who's going
to write the name?

1731
02:00:10,865 --> 02:00:11,923
Once you write in the notebook,

1732
02:00:11,999 --> 02:00:16,333
you have to continue writing
names every thirteen days!

1733
02:00:16,637 --> 02:00:18,798
The one who's going to
write the name

1734
02:00:18,873 --> 02:00:22,673
is someone who'll be executed
within thirteen days.

1735
02:00:22,743 --> 02:00:24,677
If he's still alive after thirteen days...

1736
02:00:25,112 --> 02:00:27,876
We've made a judicial bargain
to exempt him from execution.

1737
02:00:29,116 --> 02:00:32,176
- But we can't sacrifice people's lives...
- Just a little more.

1738
02:00:32,987 --> 02:00:36,514
If we just clear this up...
We'll solve the case.

1739
02:00:41,896 --> 02:00:43,989
Wh-What's this?!
A blackout?!

1740
02:00:55,109 --> 02:00:56,133
Watari?

1741
02:00:58,346 --> 02:00:59,370
Wata..!

1742
02:01:03,050 --> 02:01:05,746
Data deletion?
What's the meaning of this?!

1743
02:01:06,220 --> 02:01:10,179
I told Watari to erase
all information...

1744
02:01:10,258 --> 02:01:13,125
in the event that something
happens to him.

1745
02:01:13,561 --> 02:01:15,188
If something happens?

1746
02:01:15,429 --> 02:01:16,828
It can't be...

1747
02:01:16,931 --> 02:01:18,159
Where's the Shinigami?

1748
02:01:18,232 --> 02:01:19,722
Come to think of it.
I don't see him...

1749
02:01:22,403 --> 02:01:23,563
He's not anywhere!

1750
02:01:23,638 --> 02:01:24,900
What's the meaning of this?!

1751
02:01:25,006 --> 02:01:29,375
Everyone... The Shiniga... mi...

1752
02:01:57,672 --> 02:01:59,970
R-Ryuzaki!
What's wrong?!

1753
02:02:45,853 --> 02:02:47,946
Hey! Ryuzaki!

1754
02:02:48,155 --> 02:02:50,282
What's wrong?!
Get a hold of yourself!

1755
02:02:50,358 --> 02:02:52,326
- What's this?!
- What's going on?

1756
02:02:55,630 --> 02:02:56,892
Calm down, Light!
We're going to be killed!

1757
02:02:56,964 --> 02:03:01,128
We're going to be killed!
Watari, Ryuzaki, we're next!

1758
02:03:14,281 --> 02:03:15,771
Crap.

1759
02:03:16,283 --> 02:03:18,843
Where are you, Shinigami?!
Come out!

1760
02:03:19,020 --> 02:03:20,578
L-Light!

1761
02:03:20,655 --> 02:03:23,089
You should know something!

1762
02:03:23,257 --> 02:03:24,554
Come out!

1763
02:03:49,884 --> 02:03:51,545
Ryuzaki...

1764
02:03:51,919 --> 02:03:56,822
We held your funeral
without informing anyone...

1765
02:03:58,259 --> 02:04:01,285
We're going to pretend you're alive

1766
02:04:01,362 --> 02:04:06,061
and move the world's police
as if nothing has changed...

1767
02:04:07,401 --> 02:04:12,270
We'll catch Kira. I promise you.

1768
02:04:13,841 --> 02:04:15,968
Rest in peace...

1769
02:04:18,813 --> 02:04:20,110
That's right...

1770
02:04:21,649 --> 02:04:23,810
Let's avenge Ryuzaki!

1771
02:04:25,186 --> 02:04:29,486
Solving this case will
be our parting gift...

1772
02:04:29,557 --> 02:04:32,117
For Watari and the other victims' sake...

1773
02:04:32,193 --> 02:04:34,024
And for everyone...

1774
02:04:34,729 --> 02:04:41,328
I will get Kira executed.

1775
02:04:48,109 --> 02:04:49,508
Light...

1776
02:04:56,917 --> 02:04:58,214
Matsuda.

1777
02:05:09,663 --> 02:05:13,258
L's finally gone...

1778
02:05:13,968 --> 02:05:17,995
I guess I can't expect things to
be very interesting anymore...

1779
02:05:39,260 --> 02:05:41,728
Everyone in my way is gone.

1780
02:05:42,429 --> 02:05:44,829
Everyone else believes me.

1781
02:05:45,900 --> 02:05:48,801
It's only a matter of time before
I control the police!

1782
02:05:49,136 --> 02:05:50,831
What do you think, L?

1783
02:05:51,438 --> 02:05:53,303
I've completely won!

1784
02:05:53,908 --> 02:05:56,536
I win!

1785
02:06:16,530 --> 02:06:21,263
Ryuk, you don't expect things
to be very interesting?

1786
02:06:22,803 --> 02:06:26,899
That's not true. From here on...

1787
02:06:30,411 --> 02:06:33,209
You'll get to observe the making
of a new world.

1788
02:07:18,325 --> 02:07:23,558
I am... the god...

1789
02:07:25,432 --> 02:07:27,059
of the new world...

1790
02:07:38,012 --> 02:07:43,143
Light Yagami

1791
02:07:44,652 --> 02:07:48,713
You weren't a god at that moment...

1792
02:07:49,323 --> 02:07:51,018
You were more like...

1793
02:07:57,231 --> 02:07:58,721
So you're gone...

1794
02:08:02,937 --> 02:08:06,998
Go and see...
If you're lucky...

1795
02:08:07,074 --> 02:08:10,100
Someone amazing will
pick up the Death Note...

1796
02:08:10,210 --> 02:08:12,337
And you'll get to see
something interesting

1797
02:08:12,413 --> 02:08:14,938
that you'll never forget.

1798
02:08:19,053 --> 02:08:23,456
Isn't that right...

1799
02:08:23,524 --> 02:08:24,855
Light?

